    mc "No, [aar], but if they didn't want to tell you about it, then I'm not going to be the one to do it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1401
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_c819bfc5:

    # aar "Me parece bien. Pero, ¿cómo se están portando? No me has contestado."
    aar "That's fine with me. But how are they behaving? You haven't answered me."

