    aar "I hadn't really thought about it. I thought it was going to be... I don't know... to get to know each other better. Something private with the four of them."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1408
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_81e38309:

    # mc "[aar], creo que no entiendes a mi familia. Intentamos no guardar secretos, y en este estaban implicadas [eri], [dap], y [emm]."
    mc "[aar], I don't think you understand my family. We try not to keep secrets, and this one involved [eri], [dap], and [emm]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1410
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_a3a825e3:

