    aar "One of NTR's competitors in the world of... security operations... has received information about the change of ownership."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1429
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_1e8a5b88:

    # mc "Eso es malo, ¿no? ¿Estamos en peligro otra vez? ¿También tienen clones?"
    mc "That's bad, isn't it? Are we in danger again? Do they have clones too?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1431
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_fab57a01:

