    aar "No, it's not particularly bad. They're not going to take any violent or illegal action. And no, they don't have clones, they operate with ex-military personnel."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1432
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_6ba3a832:

    # aar "Quieren comprar NTR aprovechando lo que consideran una posición de debilidad. ¿Habéis hablado ya sobre si vais a vender vuestras acciones?"
    aar "They want to buy NTR taking advantage of what they see as a position of weakness. Have you talked yet about whether you are going to sell your shares?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1433
