    # mc "Yo no voy a venderlas y [dap] tampoco. Supongo que tú, [ama] y [eva] tampoco."
    mc "I'm not going to sell them, and [dap] isn't either. I guess you, [ama] and [eva] aren't going to put your shares in the market either."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1435
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_2223e756:

    # aar "No, no vamos a vender, con lo que podrían hacerse con un 50%% de la compañía como máximo. No es malo del todo, pero tampoco bueno."
    aar "No, we are not going to sell, so they could take over 50\% of the company at most. It's not entirely bad, but it's not good either."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1436
