    # mc "Vale, pues si se ponen en contacto, con decirle que no estamos interesados en vender hay suficiente, ¿no?"
    mc "Okay, well, if they get in touch, just telling them that we're not interested in selling is enough, right?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1445
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_f3896c95:

    # aar "Debería haber suficiente, pero tienes que hablarlo antes con tu familia. No puedes tomar una decisión por ellos."
    aar "There should be enough, but you have to talk it over with your family first. You can't actually decide for them."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1446
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_89f7514c:

    # aar "Incluso sería bueno que te reunieras con él, llevando a [ama] como guardaespaldas. Para saber qué intenciones tienen."
    aar "It would even be good for you to meet with him, taking [ama] as a bodyguard. To find out what their intentions are."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1447
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_023dbd88:

    # mc "Si no vamos a vender, ¿qué más da las intenciones que tengan?"
    mc "If we're not going to sell, who cares what their intentions are?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1449
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_4d83f4ea:

    # aar "[mc], la información es poder en este mundo. No creo que seas capaz de sacarle nada, pero [ama] sí que puede conseguir algo de información."
    aar "[mc], information is power in this world. I don't think you'll be able to get anything out of him, but [ama] sure can get some information."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1450
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_e00384c4:

    # mc "No me hace ninguna gracia ir a una reunión con un tipo que seguramente sea peligroso sin tener ni idea de nada."
    mc "It's no fun for me to go to a meeting with a guy, who is probably a dangerous man, without having a clue about anything."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1452
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_56cd97e0:

    # aar "¿Crees que ese directivo va a ser más peligroso que [ama]? *Risa*"
    aar "Do you think that manager is going to be more dangerous than [ama]? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1453
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_261ccb82:

    # mc "*Risa* En eso tienes razón. No voy a estar más protegido con nadie mejor que con ella."
    mc "*Laugh* You're right about that. I'm not going to be more protected with anyone better than with her."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1455
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_1d102f4f:

    # aar "*Risa* Que no te oiga [eva] decir eso."
    aar "*Laugh* You better hope [eva] doesn't hear you say that."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1456
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_b9e32a8d:

    # aar "Te la has terminado de ganar con el regalo de las muñecas. Un buen detalle. No la pierdas ahora."
    aar "You've won her over with the doll gift. A nice touch. Don't lose her now."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1457
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_69ecb324:

    # mc "Espera. Habías dicho que no sabías de qué hablaban con lo de las muñecas."
    mc "Wait. You had said you didn't know what they were talking about with the doll thing."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1459
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_3a98564c:

    # aar "Quería comprobar lo leal que eras hacia ellas. Lo de las muñecas era algo simple sobre lo que quizás quisieras fanfarronear."
    aar "I wanted to see how loyal you were to them. The doll thing was a simple thing you might want to brag about."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1460
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_acb236f1:

    # aar "Pero siendo algo que puede que para ti no sea importante has guardado lo que creías que era su secreto. Bien hecho."
    aar "But being something that may not be important to you, you kept what you thought was their secret. Well done."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1461
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_6f76af63:

    # mc "No me gustan estos juegos, [aar]."
    mc "I don't like this kind of game, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1463
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_3da1a804:

    # aar "A mí tampoco, te lo aseguro. Pero no sé cuánto tiempo voy a poder seguir protegiéndolas. Necesito saber que tú y tu familia lo vais a hacer cuando yo no esté."
    aar "Neither do I, I promise. But I don't know how long I'm going to be able to keep protecting them. I need to know that you and your family are going to do it when I'm gone."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1464
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_d31034f7:

    # mc "Lo haremos, no te preocupes. ¿No hay nada que pueda frenar el envejecimiento acelerado?"
    mc "We'll do it, don't worry. Is there nothing that can slow down the accelerated aging?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1466
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_c3c0825a:

    # aar "No, no hay nada. No voy a durar diez años más. Quizás ni siquiera cinco."
    aar "No, there is nothing we can do. I'm not going to last ten more years. Maybe not even five."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1467
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_84ab57b7:

    # mc "Lo siento. No tengo palabras..."
    mc "I'm sorry. I don't know what to say..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1468
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_fd33cf36:

    # aar "No te preocupes. Hace años que lo tengo asumido."
    aar "Don't worry. I accepted it many years ago."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1470
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_d08c7506:

    # aar "Volviendo al tema que nos ocupaba. Si se ponen en contacto contigo desde Iron Fist, la otra compañía, intenta tener una reunión en persona e informa a [ama]."
    aar "Back to the topic at hand. If you are contacted by Iron Fist, the other company, try to have a meeting in person and inform [ama]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1471
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_10b09256:

    # mc "De acuerdo. ¿Alguna cosa más?"
    mc "All right. Anything else?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1473
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_34537b06:

    # aar "No, eso es todo. ¿Tienes alguna pregunta?"
    aar "No, that's all. Do you have any questions?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1474
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_5a73e046:

    # mc "Sí. Me dijiste que me dirías de qué te conocía. O de qué me sonabas."
    mc "Yes. You said you'd tell me where I knew you from. Or why you looked familiar to me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1476
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_62cf7be6:

    # aar "Supongo que ya lo has pensado, pero... ¿alguna vez te han dicho que pareces mayor de tu edad?"
    aar "I guess you've already thought about it, but... Has anyone ever told you that you look older than your age?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1477
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_75c3e23a:

    # mc "Sí. No me digas que yo también soy un clon que envejece más rápido."
    mc "Yes. Don't tell me I'm a fast aging clone too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1479
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_fca3faa7:

    # aar "No, no eres un clon. Arnau, Albert, y yo somos clones tuyos."
    aar "No, you are not a clone. Arnau, Alfred, and I are your clones."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1481
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_bce8a29d:

    # aar "Tus tíos le sacaron células madre a [mar] durante su embarazo, con la excusa de hacer pruebas sobre enfermedades genéticas."
    aar "Your uncles took stem cells from [mar] during her pregnancy, with the excuse of testing you for genetic diseases."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1483
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_1e40d8c8:

    # aar "Ana se extrajo células madre durante su embarazo. Fuiste el primer sujeto al que lograron clonar."
    aar "Ana extracted stem cells during her pregnancy. You were the first subject they managed to clone."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1485
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_f3053091:

    # aar "No pareces sorprendido."
    aar "You don't look surprised."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1486
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_c909980b:

    # mc "Veo una versión joven de tu cara cada día en el espejo. Desde que te conocí, era una de las opciones que barajaba."
    mc "I see a young version of your face every day in the mirror. Since I met you, it was one of the options I was considering."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1487
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_8cb11edb:

    # mc "¿Lo saben [ama] y [eva]?"
    mc "Do [ama] and [eva] know?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1489
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_780ec8d6:

    # aar "No, no lo saben. Y preferiría que no lo supieran. Aunque no me extrañaría que lo sospecharan. Seguramente recuerdan qué aspecto teníamos hace 13 o 14 años."
    aar "No, they don't know. And I would prefer that they continue not to know. Although I wouldn't put it past them to suspect it. They probably remember what we looked like 13 or 14 years ago."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1490
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_efcb1f17:

    # aar "Nos parecíamos más a ti de lo que me parezco yo ahora. Un día atarán cabos, pero espero que tarden en hacerlo."
    aar "We were more like you than I am now. One day they'll tie things up, but I hope it takes a while."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1491
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_d0059116:

    # mc "No te preocupes, no se lo diré. Pero ahora que he confirmado mis sospechas... no sé cómo tratarte."
    mc "Don't worry, I won't tell them. But now that I've confirmed my suspicions... I don't know how to treat you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1493
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_aff66c1e:

    # aar "*Risa* Es por lo que no quiero que [ama] y [eva] lo sepan. Sería raro para ellas. Puedes tratarme como a un socio."
    aar "*Laugh* That's why I don't want [ama] and [eva] to know. It would be weird for them. You can treat me like a partner."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1494
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_3f71da55:

    # aar "No nos vamos a convertir en familia por compartir ADN."
    aar "We are not going to become family because we share DNA."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1495
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_24f9d7c8:

    # mc "Me parece bien. Raro, pero bien."
    mc "Sounds good to me. Weird, but fine."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1497
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_e7a7e5cf:

    # aar "Entonces te dejo. Tienes que hablar con tu familia sobre las acciones. Dile a cualquiera de mis chicas que me informe de vuestra decisión, por favor."
    aar "Then I'll let you go. You need to talk to your family about the shares. Tell any of my girls to inform me of your decision, please."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1498
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_14010c89:

    # mc "Lo haré. Pero son nuestras chicas."
    mc "I will. But they're our girls."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1499
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_0639f7d8:

    # aar "La próxima vez que nos veamos, supongo que será aquí, en Aruba. En dos o tres semanas más o menos deberías venir."
    aar "The next time we meet, I guess it will be here in Aruba. In two or three weeks or so you should be coming."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1500
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_e226d49b:

    # mc "¿Sólo dos o tres semanas?"
    mc "Only two or three weeks?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1502
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_2b20622b:

    # aar "Más o menos. Hay mucho trabajo que hacer y cuanto antes haya una figura visible, mejor."
    aar "More or less. There is a lot of work to do and the sooner there is a visible figurehead, the better."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1503
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_ca79b601:

    # mc "No me gusta la idea pero vale. Nos vemos en dos o tres semanas en Aruba."
    mc "I don't like the idea, but okay. See you in two or three weeks in Aruba."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1505
translate english c21s002_AaronCall_5b29d98b:

    # "Tras las despedidas, vuelves a bajar a la cocina. Tienes que hablar con [mar]."
    "After the goodbyes, you go back down to the kitchen. You need to talk to [mar]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1529
translate english c21s002_MarChat_d45b9216:

    # mc "Buenos días, Mamá. ¿Tienes un momento?"
    mc "Good morning, Mom. Do you have a moment?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1531
translate english c21s002_MarChat_152657e0:

    # mc "Buenos días, [mar]. ¿Tienes un momento?"
    mc "Good morning, [mar]. Do you have a moment?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1532
translate english c21s002_MarChat_889efd17:

    # mom "Sí, claro. Pareces preocupado. Siéntate conmigo, me estaba preparando un café."
    mom "Yes, of course. You look worried. Sit with me, I was just making a coffee. Do you want one?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1534
translate english c21s002_MarChat_e64d9ff2:

    # "Tras explicarle lo que has hablado con [aar] sobre la venta..."
    "After explaining to her what you discussed with [aar] about the sale..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1535
translate english c21s002_MarChat_84a6ec42:

    # mom "Ni [nor], ni [eri], ni yo vamos a vender. Ya lo hemos hablado. [emm] todavía no ha dicho nada, pero dudo que quiera vender."
    mom "Neither [nor], nor [eri], nor I are going to sell. We've already talked about it. [emm] hasn't said anything yet, but I doubt she wants to get rid of the shares."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1536
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f33fcc5d:

    # mom "Para ella es más lógico ser una accionista con ingresos continuos que volverse rica de un día para otro."
    mom "It makes more sense for her to be a shareholder with a steady income than to become rich overnight."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1537
translate english c21s002_MarChat_ed54918d:

    # mc "Deberíamos hablarlo con ella. Como ha dicho [aar], no puedo tomar decisiones sobre sus acciones."
    mc "We should talk it over with her. As [aar] said, I can't make decisions about her shares."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1539
translate english c21s002_MarChat_d0611e7a:

    # mom "No te preocupes, hablaré con ella hoy mismo."
    mom "Don't worry, I'll talk to her today."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1541
translate english c21s002_MarChat_eaef52fa:

    # mc "Gracias, Mamá."
    mc "Thanks, Mom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1543
translate english c21s002_MarChat_73d262ed:

    # mc "Gracias, [mar]."
    mc "Thanks, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1545
translate english c21s002_MarChat_fc444a05:

    # mom "¿Sabes cuándo se van a poner en contacto con nosotros?"
    mom "Do you know when that company is going to contact us?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1546
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c380efeb:

    # mc "Ni idea, pero si el tipo está en San Diego y [aar] quiere que tomemos la decisión hoy, supongo que será en breve."
    mc "No idea, but if the guy is in San Diego and [aar] wants us to make the decision today. I guess it will be shortly."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1547
translate english c21s002_MarChat_ef7c7929:

    # mc "Mientras no interfiera con lo de [emm] en Monterey... Ese tipo no sabe lo que es enfrentarse a [emm] enfadada."
    mc "As long as it doesn't interfere with [emm]'s thing in Monterey... That guy doesn't know what it's like to face an angry [emm]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1549
translate english c21s002_MarChat_77c4bbb4:

    # mom "*Risa* En ese caso, se enterarían de que [ama] es un corderito sobre el que no hay nada que temer."
    mom "*Laugh* In that case, they would learn that [ama] is a little lamb about whom there is nothing to fear."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1550
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f23a0bc9:

    # mc "Bueno, pues te voy a dejar. Tengo que llevar a [meg] a la estación de autobuses."
    mc "Well, I'm going to leave you. I have to give [meg] a ride to the bus station."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1553
translate english c21s002_MarChat_30ab2cd5:

    # mom "Antes de que te vayas..."
    mom "Before you go..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1554
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c3861053:

    # mc "¿Qué ha pasado ahora? *Risa*"
    mc "What happened now? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1556
translate english c21s002_MarChat_df11d1b2:

    # mom "No, no ha pasado nada... ahora."
    mom "No, nothing happened... now."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1557
translate english c21s002_MarChat_bd6d4dd1:

    # mom "Ayer, cuando estuve en tu habitación... con [sam]..."
    mom "Yesterday, when I was in your room... with [sam]..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1558
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f79a7e43:

    # mc "¿Te molestó vernos allí a los dos?"
    mc "Did it bother you to see us both there?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1560
translate english c21s002_MarChat_131d701e:

    # mom "¿Qué? ¡No! Me alegra mucho que estés con [sam]. Es una mujer fantástica."
    mom "What? No! I'm so glad you're with [sam]! She's a fantastic woman."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1561
translate english c21s002_MarChat_8606410d:

    # mc "¿Entonces cuál es el problema?"
    mc "Then, what's the problem?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1563
translate english c21s002_MarChat_7fac0b6b:

    # mom "No es que haya ningún problema... durante la fiesta estuvimos hablando..."
    mom "No, there's no problem... during the party we were talking..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1564
translate english c21s002_MarChat_78f12039:

    # mom "Sabes que todo esto empezó con una broma sobre compartirte..."
    mom "You know this all started with a joke about sharing you..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1565
translate english c21s002_MarChat_65f9676b:

    # mc "Sí..."
    mc "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1568
translate english c21s002_MarChat_99ed1929:

    # mom "Después de lo que pasó con [emm]..."
    mom "After what happened with [emm]..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1569
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c23a761d:

    # mom "Y sabes que [sam] es mi mejor amiga..."
    mom "And you know [sam] is my best friend..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1570
translate english c21s002_MarChat_bc25888e:

    # mc "Me gusta a donde va esto..."
    mc "I like where this is going..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1572
translate english c21s002_MarChat_13ca5fec:

    # mom "¿Me vas a hacer decirlo?"
    mom "Are you going to make me say it?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1573
translate english c21s002_MarChat_b52cc728:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿A qué te refieres? Siempre dices que soy un chico muy inocente que no capta las indirectas."
    mc "*Laugh* What do you mean? You always say I'm a very innocent boy who doesn't catch the hints."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1575
translate english c21s002_MarChat_db2cd72a:

    # mom "*Risa* Y un poco capullo también."
    mom "*Laugh* And a bit of an asshole too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1576
translate english c21s002_MarChat_26548d8c:

    # mc "*Risa* Sí, sí. Soy un capullo. Pero decías que [sam.nick] es tu mejor amiga..."
    mc "*Laugh* Yeah, yeah, I'm an asshole. But you were saying [sam.nick] is your best friend..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1578
translate english c21s002_MarChat_3a1c51e7:

    # mom "Vale... estuvimos hablando..."
    mom "Okay... we were talking..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1579
translate english c21s002_MarChat_4b206a4c:

    # mom "Y nos gustaría compartirte de verdad en el futuro..."
    mom "And we would like to share you in the future... for real."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1581
translate english c21s002_MarChat_026f4984:

    # mom "Como hicimos [emm] y yo. Aunque [sam] aún no sabe nada sobre eso."
    mom "Like [emm] and I did. Although [sam] doesn't know anything about it yet."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1582
translate english c21s002_MarChat_7859df39:

    # mc "Creo que puedo liberar las próximas semanas de mi agenda y haceros un hueco. *Risa* Excepto por lo de [emm] en Monterey, claro."
    mc "I think I can free up the next few weeks of my schedule and squeeze you guys in. *Laugh* Except for the [emm] thing in Monterey, of course."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1583
translate english c21s002_MarChat_03b9a4c4:

    # mc "Hablando en serio. Me encantaría, pero solo si las dos lo queréis de verdad."
    mc "Seriously. I'd love to, but only if you both really want it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1585
translate english c21s002_MarChat_0c3a8aeb:

    # mom "No estamos diciendo de hacerlo inmediatamente. Quizás cuando vuelvas de Aruba. Las dos queremos tenerte para nosotras solas unas cuantas veces más antes de hacer algo así."
    mom "We are not saying to do it immediately. Maybe when you get back from Aruba. We both want to have alone time with you a few more times before we do something like that."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1586
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f834aa1a:

    # mom "Pero queríamos saber si te gustaría... hacer un trío con las dos."
    mom "But we wanted to know if you would like to... have a threesome with both of us."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1587
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f052f0b9:

    # mc "Si alguna vez digo que no me apetece algo así, llévame al médico. *Risa* Algo no funcionará en mi cerebro."
    mc "If I ever say I don't fancy a threesome with you two, take me to the doctor! *Laugh* Because something will be wrong in my brain in that case!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1589
translate english c21s002_MarChat_b218ef31:

    # mom "Gracias, mi amor. Si hubieras dicho que no, me hubiera sentido estúpida."
    mom "Thank you, my love. If you had said no, I would have felt stupid."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1590
translate english c21s002_MarChat_2b012876:

    # mc "No podría haber rechazado algo así nunca."
    mc "I couldn't have ever turned down something like that."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1591
translate english c21s002_MarChat_066b0a75:

    # mc "Pero ahora en serio, tengo que ir a llevar a [meg]."
    mc "But seriously now, I have to go take [meg] to the bus station."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1593
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f7535321:

    # mom "Una última cosa..."
    mom "One last thing..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1594
translate english c21s002_MarChat_1afe9f90:

    # mc "Dime."
    mc "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1595
translate english c21s002_MarChat_bb2f6982:

    # mom "¿Qué opinas de [kim]?"
    mom "What do you think about [kim]?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1596
translate english c21s002_MarChat_929758f7:

    # mc "Me parece que es una chica fantástica, y parece que se está integrando muy bien."
    mc "I think she's a fantastic girl, and she seems to be integrating very well."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1597
translate english c21s002_MarChat_1014758b:

    # mc "Diría que, además, se lleva muy bien contigo."
    mc "I would say that, in addition, she gets along with you very well."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1599
translate english c21s002_MarChat_4c342753:

    # mom "Sí, creo que en su caso no eres el favorito, sino que me ha tocado a mí. *Risa*"
    mom "Yes, I think in your case you are not the favorite. This time it looks like it's me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1601
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c1b8f8c0:

    # mom "¡Y no es que tenga ninguna queja sobre ello! No me malinterpretes."
    mom "And it's not that I have any complaints about it! Don't get me wrong."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1602
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c1b00533:

    # mc "Me lo imagino, pero ¿por qué lo preguntabas?"
    mc "I can imagine, but why did you ask?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1604
translate english c21s002_MarChat_ea65733b:

    # mom "Es una chica muy sensible, y ayer intentó hablarme de ti un par de veces, pero nos interrumpieron y no quiso seguir hablando del tema."
    mom "She's a very sensitive girl, and she tried to talk to me about you a couple of times yesterday, but we were interrupted and she didn't want to talk about it anymore."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1605
translate english c21s002_MarChat_6e3b3c2b:

    # mom "¿Sabes de qué va?"
    mom "Do you know what it's about?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1606
translate english c21s002_MarChat_40a0fdc0:

    # mc "Tengo alguna idea sobre ello, pero creo que, si lo quería hablar contigo, debes hablarlo con ella."
    mc "I think I know what it's about, but I think that, if she wanted to talk it over with you, you should discuss it with her."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1607
translate english c21s002_MarChat_f5447a9c:

    # mc "Podría estar equivocado y que quisiera hablar de cualquier otra cosa."
    mc "I could be wrong and maybe she wants to talk about something else."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1609
translate english c21s002_MarChat_2f33f3bd:

    # mom "Creo que tienes razón. No debería habértelo preguntado a ti, sino a ella."
    mom "I think you're right. I shouldn't have asked you, I should have talked with her."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1610
translate english c21s002_MarChat_b4d1f2ec:

    # mom "Ahora deberías irte a buscar a [meg] o vais a llegar tarde."
    mom "Now you should go get [meg] or you're going to be late."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1613
translate english c21s002_MarChat_61ac67b1:

    # mom "Hasta luego, mi amor."
    mom "See you later, my love."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1615
translate english c21s002_MarChat_c966101d:

    # mc "Hasta luego, Mamá."
    mc "See you later, Mom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1618
translate english c21s002_MarChat_fd0b2265:

    # mc "Hasta luego, mi vida."
    mc "See you later, my life."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1620
translate english c21s002_MarChat_5aec6711:

    # mc "Hasta luego, [mar]."
    mc "See you later, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1631
translate english c21s002_Megan_04fc0305:

    # "Después de recoger a [meg] en su habitación y llevarla a la estación de autobuses..."
    "After picking [meg] up at her room and taking her to the bus station..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1632
translate english c21s002_Megan_3c65a76f:

    # mc "¿Qué tal lo has pasado el fin de semana?"
    mc "Did you have a good weekend at home?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1633
translate english c21s002_Megan_d15af0eb:

    # meg "Ha sido genial. Me lo he pasado muy bien y ha sido fantástico conocer a todo el mundo."
    meg "It's been great. I've had a great time and it's been wonderful to meet everyone."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1634
translate english c21s002_Megan_c24435be:

    # mc "¿Te sientes más a gusto ahora, después de la fiesta de cumpleaños?"
    mc "Do you feel more at ease now, after the birthday party?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1636
translate english c21s002_Megan_bd07e85a:

    # meg "No me la imaginaba así. Con lo locos que estáis todos, esperaba algo más salvaje. Fue bastante tranquila."
    meg "I didn't imagine it like this. As crazy as you all are, I was expecting something wilder. It was pretty mellow."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1637
translate english c21s002_Megan_3567414e:

    # mc "Creo que la parte más salvaje estuvo en el jacuzzi. Las chicas se lo pasaron muy bien."
    mc "I think the wildest part was in the hot tub. The girls had a great time."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1639
translate english c21s002_Megan_6fcafd80:

    # meg "Bueno, Jamaal también se puso muy salvaje cuando tú te fuiste. *Risa* Y no me refiero solo a su capacidad para comer."
    meg "Well, Jamaal got pretty savage when you left, too. *Laugh* And I don't just mean his eating ability."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1640
translate english c21s002_Megan_12ea3e63:

    # meg "Empezó a contar chistes sobre todo el mundo, menos [mad] y las estudiantes. Supongo que aún no tiene suficiente material."
    meg "He started telling jokes about everyone but [mad] and the students. I guess he doesn't have enough material yet."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1641
translate english c21s002_Megan_1fee9104:

    # mc "Es un monologuista frustrado. *Risa* Por eso le dejo hablar solo muchas veces."
    mc "He's a frustrated stand-up comedian. *Laugh* That's why I let him talk to himself a lot of the time."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1643
translate english c21s002_Megan_388d91bd:

    # meg "*Risa* Sois tal para cual. Me encanta cómo os metéis el uno con el otro. Se nota que os queréis."
    meg "*Laugh* You two are a match made in heaven. I love the way you mess with each other. I can tell you love him almost as a brother."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1644
translate english c21s002_Megan_08b7f981:

    # mc "Ya sabes que es el deber de cualquier amo querer a su mascota. *Risa*"
    mc "You know it is the duty of any master to love his pet. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1646
translate english c21s002_Megan_a92ae0ce:

    # meg "¿Ves? A eso me refiero. *Risa*"
    meg "See? That's what I'm talking about. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1647
translate english c21s002_Megan_cfc7a130:

    # mc "Hablando de cosas más serias. ¿Cuándo vuelves? ¿Vendrás el próximo fin de semana también?"
    mc "Speaking of more serious things, when are you coming back? Are you coming next weekend too?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1649
translate english c21s002_Megan_d5787976:

    # meg "Trabajo hasta el miércoles en Westport y empiezo el viernes aquí de nuevo."
    meg "I work through Wednesday in Westport, and I start here again on Friday."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1650
translate english c21s002_Megan_481ae79b:

    # meg "[mar] me ha dicho que venga el jueves, pero no estoy segura. Normalmente los jueves los aprovecho para hacer la limpieza en casa."
    meg "[mar] told me to come on Thursday, but I'm not sure. I usually take advantage of Thursdays to do cleaning at home."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1651
translate english c21s002_Megan_052760bc:

    # mc "*Risa* Si no estás en casa no verás si está sucia, y se ensuciará menos."
    mc "*Laugh* If you're not in your apartment, you won't see if it's dirty, and it will get less messy."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1653
translate english c21s002_Megan_5a02c626:

    # meg "*Risa* ¡Hombres!"
    meg "*Laugh* Men!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1655
translate english c21s002_Megan_71dc5177:

    # meg "Ya veremos. El jueves o el viernes estaré de nuevo aquí. Además ya tendré el coche arreglado."
    meg "We'll see. Thursday or Friday I'll be here again. Plus, I will already have the car fixed by then."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1656
translate english c21s002_Megan_e1b0ccdd:

    # mc "Entonces espero verte el jueves."
    mc "Then I look forward to seeing you on Thursday."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1659
translate english c21s002_Megan_486a9a17:

    # meg "Tú también puedes venir a mi casa, si quieres. Sólo está a 35 minutos."
    meg "You can come to my place, too, if you want. It's only 35 minutes away."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1660
translate english c21s002_Megan_34c0c949:

    # mc "Si puedo lo haré."
    mc "I will if I can."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1661
translate english c21s002_Megan_a08a7190:

    # mc "Esta semana va a ser complicada."
    mc "Although this week is going to be complicated."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1663
translate english c21s002_Megan_bbdca4c9:

    # meg "Lo sé. Tienes lo de [emm] entre las otras miles de cosas que tienes que hacer."
    meg "I know. You have the [emm] thing among the thousands of other things you have to do."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1665
translate english c21s002_Megan_051cbb70:

    # meg "Por allí llega mi autobús."
    meg "Oh, here comes my bus."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1670
translate english c21s002_Megan_ab1de559:

    # meg "Te veo el jueves o el viernes. Seguramente el jueves por la noche."
    meg "See you on Thursday or Friday. Thursday night, almost for sure."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1671
translate english c21s002_Megan_afd5ac81:

    # mc "Hasta el jueves, [meg]."
    mc "See you on Thursday, [meg]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1673
translate english c21s002_Megan_00700b65:

    # "[meg] desaparece en el interior del autobús."
    "[meg] disappears inside the bus."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1674
translate english c21s002_Megan_51ef8b47:

    # "Te acabas de dar cuenta de que no lleva la maleta que trajo. ¿Ha dejado ropa en casa?"
    "You just noticed she wasn't carrying the suitcase she brought when she arrived. Did she leave some clothes and the suitcase at home?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1678
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_79f93db8:

    # "Justo al irse el autobús..."
    "Just as the bus is leaving..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1679
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1681
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_b9b20d75:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1683
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_ff033294:

    # ama "Solo quería recordarte que hoy habíamos quedado para tomar un café y hablar de mis ideas sobre NTR. ¿A qué hora te iría bien?"
    ama "I just wanted to remind you that we were meeting for a cup of coffee today, to talk about my ideas regarding NTR. What time would be good for you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1684
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_2e084d07:

    # mc "Estoy en la estación de autobuses ahora mismo. Como algo rápido y podemos quedar. ¿En 30 minutos te va bien?"
    mc "I'm at the bus station right now. I'll eat something quick and we can meet up. 30 minutes is good for you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1686
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_ed11e94d:

    # ama "Perfecto. Te mando la dirección de un café que tienes cerca y podemos quedar allí."
    ama "Perfect. I'll send you the address of a cafe downtown and we can meet there."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1687
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_2a5423d0:

    # mc "Genial. Te veo en 30 minutos. Hasta ahora."
    mc "Great. See you in 30 minutes. I'm going to eat something now."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1688
translate english c21s003_NoKiaraDate_347719c3:

    # ama "Hasta ahora, [mc]."
    ama "See you in 30 minutes, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1713
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7386f7a4:

    # "Llegas a la biblioteca unos minutos antes de la hora a la que has quedado con [kia]."
    "You arrive at the library a few minutes before the time you are scheduled to meet [kia]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1714
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9ae42375:

    # "Pasaste mucho tiempo en tu época del instituto en este edificio."
    "You spent a lot of time in your high school days in this building."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1715
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b594cfce:

    # "Por un momento dudas si debes entrar o no a buscarla. Decides hacerlo."
    "For a moment you doubt whether or not you should go in and get her. You decide to do it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1717
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_11283da7:

    # mcp "(Allí está. Se ha cambiado el peinado y se ha puesto un vestido precioso. Creo que el premio a la elegancia de hoy ya tiene dueño.)"
    mcp "(There she is. She's changed her hairstyle and put on a beautiful dress. I think the award for the best dressed person today already has an owner)."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1718
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6c3c6634:

    # mcp "(Y no soy yo.)"
    mcp "(And it's not me.)"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1720
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_898d49a2:

    # "Te acercas tímidamente al mostrador donde está hablando con la Srta. Walker, la bibliotecaria canadiense de tu época de instituto. De Montreal, crees recordar."
    "You shyly approach the counter where she's talking to Miss Walker, the Canadian librarian from your high school days. From Montreal, you think she was."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1721
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_634d1076:

    # "No sabes cuánto sabe sobre vuestra relación, si es que sabe algo. O de la situación con Solomon."
    "You don't know how much she knows about your relationship, if anything. Or about the situation with Solomon."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1722
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_68ffd690:

    # mc "Hola, [kia]. Hola..."
    mc "Hello, [kia]. Hello..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1723
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e8747f1d:

    # kia "Hola, [mc]. Te presento a Geneviève, mi jefa. Gen, este es [mc], el sobrino de [nor], de quien te he hablado."
    kia "Hello, [mc]. This is Geneviève, my boss. Gen, this is [mc], [nor]'s nephew, who I told you about."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1725
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_934429e1:

    # gen "Encantada de conocerte, [mc]."
    gen "Nice to meet you, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1726
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2c25e289:

    # mc "Igualmente, Geneviève."
    mc "Likewise, Geneviève."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1727
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_29d3b3f0:

    # gen "Puedes llamarme Gen."
    gen "You can call me Gen."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1729
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a6907f6d:

    # mc "¿Estás lista para irnos?"
    mc "Are you ready to go?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1730
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_53dcdf3b:

    # kia "Sí, dame un momento que vaya a por el bolso."
    kia "Yes, give me a moment to go get my purse."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1731
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8b397a73:

    # mc "Perfecto, te espero aquí."
    mc "Perfect, I'll wait here."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1732
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b4418a13:

    # kia "Será solo un segundo."
    kia "It will be just a second."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1734
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7cae2efd:

    # gen "Así que [kia] y [eil] se están alojando en tu casa mientras acaban con el problema de termitas, ¿no?"
    gen "So [kia] and [eil] are staying at your house while they deal with the termite problem, right?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1735
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3a42f87c:

    # gen "Les estáis haciendo un favor muy grande."
    gen "You're doing them a very big favor."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1736
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7a642010:

    # mcp "(¿Termitas? Está claro que no le ha contado lo de Solomon.)"
    mcp "(Termites? She clearly hasn't told Gen about Solomon.)"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1737
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_cfd7f90b:

    # mc "Bueno, no se aloja en mi casa, sino en la de mi tía, [nor]."
    mc "Well, they aren't staying at my place, but at my aunt's, [nor]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1739
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_12ae6060:

    # gen "Tú y yo nos conocemos, ¿verdad?"
    gen "You and I have met before, haven't we?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1740
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e8944aa2:

    # mc "Pasaba mucho tiempo aquí cuando iba al instituto."
    mc "I spent a lot of time here when I was in high school."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1742
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_74fc50ac:

    # gen "*Risa* ¡No llevo tanto tiempo trabajando aquí! Sólo llevo ocho años."
    gen "*Laugh* I haven't been working here that long! I've only been here for eight years."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1743
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1752be01:

    # mc "Y hace cuatro yo estudiaba en el instituto de Newport, Srta. Walker. Es posible que no me reconozca."
    mc "And, four years ago, I was a student at Newport High School, Miss Walker. You may not recognize me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1744
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7b7a8bca:

    # mc "Pasado de peso, con la nariz metida en un libro, con un amigo en silla de ruedas..."
    mc "Overweight, with his nose stuck in a book, with a friend in a wheelchair..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1746
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_aa0f87b2:

    # gen "¿Marks? ¿[mc] Marks? ¡No puede ser!"
    gen "Marks? [mc] Marks? It can't be!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1747
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_72f95f2a:

    # mc "Puede ser. Supongo que no me dejé ningún libro por devolver cuando me fui a la universidad. *Risa*"
    mc "It can be. I guess I didn't leave any books unreturned when I went away to college. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1749
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_35b065bd:

    # gen "Estoy sorprendida... Un gran cambio..."
    gen "I am surprised... You changed a lot..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1750
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_817b71b9:

    # gen "Y ya no soy la Srta. Walker. Ahora soy la Sra. Sky."
    gen "And I'm no longer Miss Walker. I am now Mrs. Sky."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1751
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3e97c86b:

    # mc "Felicidades, Sra. Sky."
    mc "Congratulations, Mrs. Sky."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1753
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_76b619e2:

    # gen "Puedes seguir llamándome Gen. Ya no eres un adolescente."
    gen "You can keep calling me Gen. You're not a teenager anymore."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1754
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4003899d:

    # mc "Felicidades, Gen, entonces."
    mc "Congratulations, Gen, then."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1756
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_efa2a30a:

    # kia "Ya nos podemos ir, [mc]. No lo entretengas, Gen, o tendré que tomarme más tiempo para comer."
    kia "We can go now, [mc]. Don't stall him, Gen, or I'll need to take more time off for lunch."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1757
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f9fc42cb:

    # mc "Nos estábamos poniendo al día. Gen y yo nos conocíamos de mi época de rata de biblioteca."
    mc "We were just catching up. Gen and I knew each other from my bookworm days."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1759
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e60a6b7c:

    # mc "Hasta otra, Gen."
    mc "See you next time, Gen."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1760
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3357fab1:

    # gen "Hasta otra, [mc]."
    gen "See you again, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1762
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9af56f4c:

    # kia "Vuelvo en una hora... más o menos."
    kia "I'll be back in an hour... give or take."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1764
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ff564463:

    # kia "¿Dónde has decidido que vayamos a comer?"
    kia "Where have you decided to go for lunch?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1765
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b2e3f62c:

    # mc "Un restaurante que me ha recomendado Tía [bet]. Es sorprendente que en una semana conozca tantos restaurantes."
    mc "A restaurant Aunt [bet] recommended to me. It's amazing that, in only a week, she knows so many restaurants."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1766
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a85a021e:

    # mc "Pero... ¿no hay beso para mí?"
    mc "But... no kiss for me?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1768
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2b7a744e:

    # kia "¿Delante de la biblioteca? Es mi puesto de trabajo... Y Gen conoce a Solomon... y..."
    kia "In front of the library? That's my work place... And Gen knows Solomon... and..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1769
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_24a6a742:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Será duro, pero lo entiendo y puedo esperar a cuando llegues a casa."
    mc "Don't worry. It will be hard, but I understand, and I can wait until you come home."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1770
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ab0752d3:

    # mc "No me gustan los secretos, pero entiendo que no quieras hacer público lo nuestro aún, hasta que se resuelva lo de Solomon."
    mc "I don't like secrets, but I understand that you don't want to go public about us yet, until Solomon's issue is settled."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1772
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f0fc850c:

    # kia "No es que no quiera hacerlo público. Me da lo mismo que la gente sepa que Solomon y yo hemos roto. No voy a volver con él nunca."
    kia "It's not that I don't want to go public. I don't care if people know that Solomon and I broke up. I'm not going back to him ever."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1773
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_cce4706b:

    # kia "Pero hace una semana estaba con él y ahora estoy contigo... todo el mundo va a pensar que soy... una zorra que se ha ido con un hombre más joven."
    kia "But a week ago I was with him and now I'm with you... everyone's going to think I'm... a slut who's gone off with a younger man."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1775
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0efd211a:

    # mc "[kia], escúchame. En casa podremos repetir lo de anoche si quieres. Te dije que no teníamos que hacer nada que no quisieras hacer"
    mc "[kia], listen to me. At home, we can repeat last night if you want to. I told you we didn't have to do anything you didn't want to do."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1776
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d1a401c8:

    # mc "Y si una de las cosas que no quieres hacer es que te bese delante de la biblioteca, no hay ningún problema."
    mc "And if one of the things you don't want to do is have me kiss you in front of the library, that's not a problem."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1778
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_63650acf:

    # mc "No quiero estropear nuestra primera... o segunda cita... por una nimiedad como esta."
    mc "I don't want to spoil our first... or second date... over a trifle like this."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1779
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e36381cf:

    # mc "Estás preciosa, me encanta lo que te has hecho en el pelo y ese color de pintalabios te favorece mucho."
    mc "You look beautiful, I love what you've done to your hair and that lipstick color really suits you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1780
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_eabac296:

    # mc "Voy a tener muchas ocasiones de comerme ese pintalabios, pero sólo si no lo estropeamos hoy."
    mc "I'm going to have plenty of chances to eat that lipstick, but only if we don't mess up today's date."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1782
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_60bfadf0:

    # mc "¿Te parece bien si vamos a comer? Mi idea de una cita no es discutir con una preciosa mujer en la calle ni hacerla sentir mal."
    mc "Is it okay with you if we go to get lunch? My idea of a date doesn't include arguing with a beautiful woman in the street or making her feel bad."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1783
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7e6a20e0:

    # kia "Vamos... pero no creas que te va a ser fácil estropear hoy. Y menos si, como {b}casi{/b} siempre, aciertas en lo que tienes que decir."
    kia "Let's go... but don't think it's going to be easy for you to mess up today's date. Least of all if, like {b}almost{/b} always, you nail what you have to say."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1784
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f4d8ef39:

    # mc "*Risa* Es un defecto con el que tendrás que lidiar. No acierto siempre, pero sí las suficientes veces."
    mc "*Laugh* It's a flaw you'll have to deal with. I don't nail it all the time, but I get it right enough times."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1785
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_44d2b74e:

    # mc "Vamos antes de que se haga más tarde."
    mc "Let's go before it gets any later."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1787
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_040b5c5b:

    # mc "No sé por qué no me imaginé que sería una pizzería, habiéndolo recomendado Tía [bet]."
    mc "I don't know why I didn't figure it would be a pizzeria, having been recommended by Aunt [bet]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1788
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_86dbd28c:

    # kia "*Risa* ¿De verdad es tan adicta a la pizza?"
    kia "*Laugh* Is she really that addicted to pizza?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1789
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_fb71eec9:

    # mc "*Risa* Supongo que la gula es el único pecado que se permite. ¿Y qué mejor que cometerlo con pizza?"
    mc "*Laugh* I guess gluttony is the only sin she allows herself to fall into. And what better way than committing it with pizza?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1791
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b424f89a:

    # "Después de que el camarero os siente en una mesa no tan apartada como te hubiera gustado..."
    "After the waiter seats you at a table not as far from other customers as you would have liked..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1792
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2095de9e:

    # mc "¿Qué te apetece comer?"
    mc "What do you feel like eating?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1793
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2061c43f:

    # kia "Si por mí fuera, haría como [bet] y pediría una pizza, pero entre el tiempo que van a tardar y lo lenta que soy comiendo, la cita no daría para nada más."
    kia "If it were up to me, I'd do like [bet] and order a pizza, but between how long it's going to take and how slow I am at eating, the date wouldn't allow for anything else."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1794
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c5db446e:

    # kia "Con lo que creo que pediré esta ensalada. Tiene buena pinta."
    kia "So, I think I'll order this avocado salad. It looks good."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1795
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_977aa4a9:

    # mc "¿Tienes algún plan para después de comer?"
    mc "Do you have any plans for after lunch?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1799
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c279c58a:

    # kia "Había pensado en dar un paseo antes de volver a la biblioteca... si te apetece."
    kia "I had thought about taking a walk before going back to the library... if you feel like it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1800
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9d638618:

    # mc "Me encantan los paseos contigo. *Risa* Pero no podremos hacer tantas pausas como anoche."
    mc "I love walks with you. *Laugh* But we won't be able to take as many pauses as we did last night."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1802
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4cb0af9f:

    # kia "*Risa* No me refería a ese tipo de paseo."
    kia "*Laugh* I didn't mean that kind of walk."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1803
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4db7ab3b:

    # mc "Lo sé. *Risa* Que sean dos ensaladas, pero no le digas a [mar] que he pedido una ensalada en un restaurante."
    mc "I know. *Laugh* Make it two salads, but don't tell [mar] I ordered a salad at a restaurant."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1805
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_974b0be7:

    # kia "*Risa* ¿Por qué?"
    kia "*Laugh* Why?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1806
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_46df123c:

    # mc "No te creería. *Risa* ¿Pagar por algo verde? Orégano o albahaca, sí. Lechuga, quizás, dentro de una hamburguesa. Broccoli, nunca."
    mc "She wouldn't believe you. *Laugh* Paying for something green? Oregano or basil, yes. Lettuce, maybe, if it's inside a burger. Broccoli, never."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1808
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_75b5078a:

    # kia "*Risa* Si fueras hijo mío comerías de todo."
    kia "*Laugh* If you were my son you would eat all kinds of things."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1809
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9bf7c2c9:

    # mc "*Risa* Prefiero ser tu novio y olvidarme del broccoli."
    mc "*Laugh* I'd rather be your boyfriend and forget about broccoli."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1811
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_890574b6:

    # kia "Yo también... A lo del novio. No tengo ningún problema con el broccoli."
    kia "Me too... To the boyfriend thing. I have no problem with the broccoli."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1813
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_bae6e3a4:

    # mc "Te cedo mi parte de la producción mundial de broccoli. *Risa* Para que veas que tienes un novio generoso."
    mc "I'll gift you my share of the world's broccoli production. *Laugh* So you can see you have a generous boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1815
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6c944c47:

    # kia "*Risa* Es super generoso de tu parte."
    kia "*Laugh* That's super selfless of you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1816
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_13c4ada8:

    # mc "¿Sabes que me encanta verte reír?"
    mc "Do you know how much I love to see you laugh?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1818
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1fa740fc:

    # kia "Gracias, pero ¿sabes que [eil] me habló de tu costumbre de intentar ruborizarla?"
    kia "Thank you, but do you know that [eil] told me about your habit of trying to make her blush?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1819
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ed8042b5:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Maldita chivata!"
    mc "*Laugh* Damn snitch!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1821
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_31f7727d:

    # kia "¡Devuelve esa mano ahí ahora mismo!"
    kia "Put that hand back here right now!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1822
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_66e26340:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡A tus órdenes!"
    mc "*Laugh* At your command!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1825
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_82e507c2:

    # kia "*Risa* Ahora que las dos salimos contigo, me ha dado algunos consejos. Y me ha explicado algunos de tus trucos para hacerla sentir bien."
    kia "*Laugh* Now that we're both dating you, she gave me some tips. And she explained to me some of your tricks to make her feel good."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1827
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_04b2472b:

    # kia "*Risa* Me ha explicado muchas cosas de cuando salíais juntos. Supongo que quería ponerme en sobre aviso sobre tus viejos trucos para hacerla sentir bien."
    kia "*Laugh* She explained to me a lot of things from when you were dating. I guess she wanted to put me on notice about your old tricks to make her feel good."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1828
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_44dc4434:

    # mc "*Risa* Tendré que encontrar trucos nuevos, entonces. La compañía los merece."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll have to find new tricks, then. The lady deserves them."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1830
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1432e0f3:

    # kia "¿Puedo serte sincera?"
    kia "Can I be honest with you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1831
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_28927394:

    # mc "Siempre."
    mc "Always."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1833
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0578fcb0:

    # kia "Si lo que dices es sincero, no me importa que se lo hayas dicho con anterioridad a mi hija. O a otras mujeres."
    kia "If what you say is sincere, I don't care if you have said it before to my daughter. Or to other women."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1834
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4ab6eb4e:

    # kia "No quiero que digas cosas que no sientes sólo para hacerme sentir bien, pero tampoco necesito que inventes frases bonitas cada día."
    kia "I don't want you to say things you don't feel just to make me feel good, but I don't need you to make up nice lines every day either."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1835
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_abe63749:

    # kia "Si sientes realmente lo que dices, me va a gustar igualmente."
    kia "If you really feel what you say, I'm going to like it anyway."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1836
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_95e51857:

    # mc "Entendido. Entonces... ¿Sabes que me encanta verte reír? *Risa*"
    mc "I understand. Then... You know how much I love to see you laugh? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1838
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1e2e1528:

    # kia "*Risa* ¡Idiota!"
    kia "*Laugh* You idiot!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1839
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a77e5548:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Hey! Has dicho que podía repetir cosas si era sincero. Y lo he sido. Me encanta verte reír."
    mc "*Laugh* Hey! You said I could repeat things if I was sincere. And I've been sincere. I love to see you laugh."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1841
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_12adb927:

    # kia "Y a mí me encanta que me hagas reír..."
    kia "And I love it when you make me laugh..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1843
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b85e53b2:

    # kia "Es tan diferente a cuando iba a comer con Solomon..."
    kia "It's so different from when I was going to lunch with Solomon..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1844
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_04f1bee2:

    # mc "¿Solomon? ¿Quién es Solomon? El nombre me suena. Algo de partir un bebé por la mitad, ¿no?"
    mc "Solomon? Who is Solomon? The name rings a bell. Something about splitting a baby in half, right?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1845
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0e916f4b:

    # mc "Pero no eres tan mayor como para haber ido a comer con él... *Risa*"
    mc "But you're not old enough to have gone to lunch with him, right? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1847
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0c1f5e70:

    # kia "*Risa* Realmente eres idiota. Me acabas de llamar vieja en nuestra segunda cita."
    kia "*Laugh* You really are an idiot. You just called me old on our second date."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1848
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0f5ad404:

    # mc "¡Oops! El chiste se me ha ido de las manos."
    mc "Oops! The joke got out of hand."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1850
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c96dfcd9:

    # kia "Sé que no está bien que hable de él en una cita contigo y prometo que será la última vez que lo haga."
    kia "I know it's not okay for me to talk about him on a date with you, and I promise it will be the last time I do it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1851
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_04e443a7:

    # kia "Con él siempre tenía que estar alerta para no decir algo que le molestara."
    kia "With him, I always had to be on my toes not to say something that would upset him."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1852
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_98d3c2c0:

    # kia "Para que no bebiera demasiado."
    kia "Nervous that he would drink too much."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1853
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f8e57f27:

    # kia "Para que no montara un espectáculo si algún hombre me miraba..."
    kia "Uneasy that he would make a scene if any man looked at me..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1854
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ed80e219:

    # mc "Lo entiendo, no tenía que ser cómodo."
    mc "I understand, I guess it wasn't very nice to go out to lunch with him."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1856
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3bb71433:

    # kia "No, no lo era. Y a eso me refiero con que esto es diferente."
    kia "No, it wasn't. And that's what I mean by this is different."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1857
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_655cfbf9:

    # kia "Contigo, lo único que tengo que temer es no poder resistir las ganas de besarte en medio del restaurante."
    kia "With you, the only thing I have to fear is not being able to withstand the urge to kiss you in the middle of the restaurant."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1858
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4613651e:

    # kia "Me haces sentir... relajada."
    kia "You make me feel... relaxed."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1859
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_15014567:

    # mc "Solomon es una de las personas a las que no me gustaría parecerme. Si alguna vez empiezo a comportarme como él, avísame para dejar de hacerlo."
    mc "Solomon is one of the people I wouldn't want to be like. If I ever start behaving like him, let me know so I can stop."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1861
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_dcfcb449:

    # kia "Los dos respiráis. *Risa* Creo que ahí acaban las similitudes."
    kia "You both breathe. *Laugh* I think that's where the similarities end."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1862
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_726e8e80:

    # mc "*Risa* Y, en mi caso, no lo considero un desperdicio de oxígeno."
    mc "*Laugh* And, in my case, I don't consider it a waste of oxygen."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1863
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5b0f932d:

    # kia "*Risa* No, no lo es."
    kia "*Laugh* No, it's not."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1865
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d84d6fa3:

    # mc "¿Puedes pedir la ensalada de pasta y un agua con gas para mí? Tengo que ir al lavabo."
    mc "Can you order the pasta salad and a sparkling water for me? I have to go to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1866
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_fae66d88:

    # kia "¿Ensalada de pasta? Habías dicho algo verde..."
    kia "Pasta salad? You said something green..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1867
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9ae059ac:

    # mc "La pasta en la ensalada es verde, roja, y blanca. *Risa* No esperabas que pidiera lechuga o endivias, ¿verdad?"
    mc "The pasta in the salad is green, red, and white. *Laugh* You didn't expect me to order lettuce or endive, did you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1868
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d93fd5d3:

    # mc "Paso a paso..."
    mc "Step by step..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1870
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4bb7ff47:

    # kia "*Risa* Vale, aceptaré pasta verde como ensalada. Creo que lleva una ínfima porción de espinacas."
    kia "*Laugh* Okay, I'll accept green pasta as a salad. I think it has a tiny portion of spinach in it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1871
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_802c91c8:

    # mc "Suficiente para mí."
    mc "Good enough for me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1873
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c65d2a7d:

    # "Sorprendes a [kia] con un beso antes de ir al lavabo. La sorpresa inicial pasa en seguida."
    "You surprise [kia] with a kiss before going to the restroom. The initial surprise passes in just two seconds before she returns the kiss."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1875
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f74dc452:

    # kia "Pero..."
    kia "But..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1876
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_423d8675:

    # mc "Luego, cielo. *Risa* Tengo que ir al lavabo."
    mc "Later, honey. *Laugh* I need to go to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1877
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_debea350:

    # mc "Y esto no es la puerta de la biblioteca."
    mc "And this {b}is not{/b} the library entrance."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1879
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8365c687:

    # mc "Ya estoy de vuelta. ¿Han tomado nota?"
    mc "I'm back. Did you order the food?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1880
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_45d0364b:

    # kia "Sí. No tenían la ensalada de pasta y te he pedido un combo de lechugas y espinacas."
    kia "Yes. They were out of pasta salad, and I ordered a lettuce and spinach combo for you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1881
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_27c68bcf:

    # mc "*Risa* Un restaurante italiano sin pasta. ¿Se está acabando el mundo?"
    mc "*Laugh* An Italian restaurant with no pasta. Is the world coming to an end?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1883
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9acb8625:

    # kia "*Risa* Estoy bromeando. He pedido tu ensalada rebosante de calorías."
    kia "*Laugh* I'm kidding. I ordered your overflowing calorie-packed salad."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1884
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7cb16a11:

    # kia "Pero te hubieras merecido la lechuga por ese beso a traición. *Risa*"
    kia "But you would have deserved the lettuce for that treacherous kiss. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1885
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e24315f5:

    # mc "Era para que pudieras soportar mejor las ganas de besarme en medio del restaurante. Ahora te puedes relajar aún más."
    mc "It was so you could better withstand the urge to kiss me in the middle of the restaurant. Now you can relax even more."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1887
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a982092f:

    # kia "A ti nadie te ha dicho nunca que besas muy bien, ¿verdad?"
    kia "No one has ever told you that you're a great kisser, right?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1888
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_640090e0:

    # mc "Si te soy sincero, me lo han dicho alguna vez. No preguntes quién."
    mc "If I'm being honest, I've been told that once or twice. Don't ask by whom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1890
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3718abcf:

    # kia "*Risa* Era una pregunta retórica, idiota. Sé que [eil] te lo ha dicho muchas veces. Alguna vez incluso la oí decírtelo."
    kia "*Laugh* It was a rhetorical question, you idiot. I know [eil] told you that many times. I even heard her tell you once or twice."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1892
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7bf62b15:

    # kia "¿Tú crees que un beso como ese va a quitarme las ganas de darte más?"
    kia "Do you think a kiss like that is going to take away my desire to kiss you even more?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1893
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_99ca66d3:

    # mc "Espero que no. Me gusta el sabor de ese pintalabios."
    mc "I hope not. I like the taste of your lipstick."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1895
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5b59703b:

    # kia "¡Dios mío! ¿Qué he hecho yo para merecer un idiota como este?"
    kia "For God's sake! What have I done to deserve an idiot like this?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1896
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c1c083cd:

    # mc "Soy el premio por ser una mujer maravillosa. *Risa* Y no se aceptan devoluciones."
    mc "I am the award for being a wonderful woman. *Laugh* And no returns accepted."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1898
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4feb9baa:

    # kia "*Risa* No pensaba devolverte a fábrica. No eres {b}tan{/b} defectuoso."
    kia "*Laugh* I wasn't planning on returning you to the factory. You're not {b}that{/b} defective."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1899
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ca2064ab:

    # mc "*Risa* No sé si ofenderme o tomármelo como un cumplido..."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't know whether to be offended or take it as a compliment..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1901
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_37786e99:

    # "Cuando traen vuestras dos ensaladas (y sí, una ensalada de pasta {b}es{/b} una ensalada) empieza una comida llena de risas."
    "When they bring your two salads (and yes, a pasta salad {b}is{/b} a salad) a lunch full of laughter begins."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1902
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5eb6f5b9:

    # "[kia] está relajada y os lo pasáis bien. Habláis de todo y de nada."
    "[kia] is relaxed and you have a great time. You talk about everything and anything."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1903
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6638e4f2:

    # "Habláis de su trabajo, del dormitorio, y de NTR."
    "You talk about her job, the dorm, and NTR."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1904
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_38379001:

    # "Charláis sobre [eil] y del resto de las mujeres de la familia."
    "You chat about [eil] and the rest of the women in the family."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1905
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3bff8f4a:

    # "Habláis de vosotros."
    "You talk about you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1906
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f44433f0:

    # "Pero, sobre todo, os reís mucho. Os reís de todo. De ti y de ella. Del mundo."
    "But, above all, you laugh a lot. You laugh at everything. At you and at her. At the world."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1908
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7dda0259:

    # "*Ring-Ring*"
    "*Ring-Ring*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1909
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7a14f67a:

    # mc "Tengo que cogerlo, [kia]. Es [ama]. Dame un segundo."
    mc "I have to answer it, [kia]. It's [ama]. Give me a second."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1910
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5b2bdc80:

    # kia "Todo el tiempo que necesites."
    kia "Take as long as you need."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1911
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b9b20d75:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. ¿Puedo ayudarte en algo?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. Can I help you with anything?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1913
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ff033294:

    # ama "Solo quería recordarte que hoy habíamos quedado para tomar un café y hablar de mis ideas sobre NTR. ¿A qué hora te iría bien?"
    ama "I just wanted to remind you that we were meeting for a cup of coffee today, to talk about my ideas regarding NTR. What time would be good for you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1914
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_dabe8d4e:

    # mc "Estoy comiendo con [kia]. ¿En una hora y media te va bien?"
    mc "I'm having lunch with [kia]. Is an hour and a half okay for you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1915
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7df02780:

    # kia "Puedes quedar antes. En 30 minutos tengo que estar de vuelta en la biblioteca."
    kia "You can meet her earlier. I have to be back at the library in around 30 minutes."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1917
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_aa011d24:

    # ama "La he escuchado. Te mando la dirección de un café que tienes cerca y podemos quedar allí. ¿En una hora?"
    ama "I heard her. I'll send you the address of a cafe near the library and we can meet there. In an hour?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1918
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4890fe3f:

    # mc "Genial. Te veo en una hora. Hasta dentro de un rato."
    mc "Great. See you in an hour. Send me the address, please."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1919
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_347719c3:

    # ama "Hasta ahora, [mc]."
    ama "See you in a while, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1921
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f8b86bf9:

    # mc "¿Por dónde íbamos?"
    mc "Where were we?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1922
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e9290c40:

    # kia "Íbamos por el momento en que pido la cuenta y nos vamos a dar ese paseo antes de que se haga más tarde."
    kia "I was going to ask for the bill and then we're going for that walk before it gets any later."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1923
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_dfdeb562:

    # mc "De acuerdo, pero la cuenta la pido yo. Fui yo quien te invitó a comer. Pago yo."
    mc "Okay, but the check is on me. I'm the one who invited you to lunch. I'm paying."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1925
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f74dc452_1:

    # kia "Pero..."
    kia "But..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1926
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_41aa0cb0:

    # mc "Si quieres pagar tú, vas a tener que invitarme tú a comer. Un trato es un trato."
    mc "If you want to pay, you're going to have to invite me for lunch another time. A deal is a deal."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1927
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_23f26bfb:

    # mc "Y así es como se consigue una tercera cita. *Risa*"
    mc "And that's how you get a third date. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1929
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9a370fb8:

    # kia "Vale, pero la próxima vez será para cenar. Tener que volver al trabajo con prisa no es lo mejor... para una tercera cita."
    kia "Okay, but next time it will be for dinner. Having to rush back to work is not the best thing... for a third date."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1930
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ce722ab8:

    # mc "Aún tenemos tiempo para ese paseo. Has dicho que tienes que volver en 30 minutos. Que ya deben ser 28."
    mc "We still have time for that walk. You said you have to be back in 30 minutes. Which should be 28 by now."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1931
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_15e51949:

    # mc "Déjame ir al mostrador a pagar, así ganaremos un par de minutos."
    mc "Let me go to the counter to pay, so we'll gain a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1933
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6bc7f6ee:

    # "Menos de diez minutos después, en un parque cercano..."
    "Less than ten minutes later, in a nearby park..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1934
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_15fe2d35:

    # kia "Y aquí es dónde vengo a comerme los perritos calientes cuando tengo que comer sola. Un libro y mi perrito."
    kia "And this is where I come to eat my hot dogs when I have to eat alone. A book and my hot dog."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1935
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_893e09f7:

    # mc "Lo sé. Vinimos con [sca], en vuestro primer día en casa."
    mc "I know. We came here with [sca], on your first day at home."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1937
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6ca23feb:

    # kia "¡Es verdad! ¡Parece que hace un mes!"
    kia "That's right! It seems like a month ago!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1938
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a5e89514:

    # mc "Mañana hace una semana, [kia]."
    mc "Tomorrow it will be a week, [kia]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1940
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f4962993:

    # kia "Lo sé. Parece increíble que en una semana mi vida haya dado este vuelco."
    kia "I know. It seems unbelievable that in one week my life turned upside down like this."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1941
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_073db8a4:

    # mc "Pero ¿estás contenta de que lo haya dado?"
    mc "But are you glad it turned around like this?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1943
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a9728b22:

    # kia "No te puedes imaginar cuánto. Y no me refiero sólo a estar contigo. Es todo. Me siento libre por primera vez en años."
    kia "You can't imagine how much. And I don't mean just being with you. It's everything. I feel free for the first time in years."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1944
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_30454c6e:

    # kia "¿Te acuerdas hace unos días, cuando te dije que teníais un castillo precioso como hogar y todas esas tonterías?"
    kia "Do you remember a few days ago, when I told you that you had a beautiful castle for a home and all that nonsense?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1945
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_924e117b:

    # mc "Fue ayer, [kia]. Estábamos en la piscina, durante la fiesta de cumpleaños."
    mc "It was yesterday, [kia]. We were by the pool, at the birthday party."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1947
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_fb9a12a4:

    # kia "¿Ayer? ¿No te lo dije durante la comida con [ama]? Se me mezclan los días... todo ha sido tan intenso..."
    kia "Yesterday? Didn't I tell you that during the lunch with [ama]? I get my days mixed up... everything has been so intense..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1948
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4c34fbdb:

    # mc "*Risa* Durante la comida con [ama] es cuando saliste corriendo. Eso fue anteayer."
    mc "*Laugh* During [ama]'s lunch is when you ran out from me. That was the day before yesterday."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1949
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5de9aba8:

    # kia "Me estoy volviendo loca. Todo parece que haya pasado hace muchísimo..."
    kia "I'm going crazy. Everything seems like it all happened so long ago..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1951
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c4f7488d:

    # kia "Sentirme aceptada por la familia, besarte ayer... por la tarde... hablar con todas las chicas después de eso... y lo que pasó por la noche..."
    kia "Feeling accepted by the family, kissing you yesterday... in the afternoon... talking to all the girls after that... and what happened last night..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1952
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_392d8bed:

    # kia "Yo llevaba una vida aburrida donde todos los días eran iguales..."
    kia "I was leading a boring life where every day was the same..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1953
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_bf02bf81:

    # mc "En casa nunca hay tiempo para aburrirse. Te adaptaste a la familia. También te adaptarás a esto."
    mc "At home there is never time to be bored. You've adapted to the family. You'll adapt to this, too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1955
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_50f0c08d:

    # kia "Lo sé, pero ahora mismo, la última semana es un torbellino de recuerdos."
    kia "I know but, right now, the last week is a whirlwind of memories."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1956
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b1e79ea5:

    # kia "Llegar a casa, la fiesta en la playa, cuando fuimos a mi antigua casa, intentar evitarte, la fiesta de cumpleaños... el beso... y lo de anoche."
    kia "Arriving home, the beach party, when we went to my old house, trying to avoid you, the birthday party... the kiss... and last night..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1958
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5c0849e7:

    # kia "Que voy a ser abuela..."
    kia "I'm going to be a grandmother..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1959
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3f92739f:

    # kia "Casi no puedo poner los recuerdos en el orden correcto."
    kia "I can hardly put the memories in the right order."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1961
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3a5e5d9b:

    # kia "Y ni siquiera hace una semana..."
    kia "And it's not even a week..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1962
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d584132f:

    # mc "Te han pasado muchas cosas importantes en esta semana. Es normal. A veces a mí también me cuesta."
    mc "A lot of important things have happened to you this week. It's normal. Sometimes it's hard for me too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1963
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_afe9bcb6:

    # mc "Pero tengo una pregunta... Después del beso de ayer por la tarde, las chicas te secuestraron durante un buen rato. ¿Qué te dijeron?"
    mc "But I have a question... After the kiss yesterday afternoon, the girls kidnapped you for quite a while. What did they tell you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1965
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_eb884940:

    # kia "*Risa* ¡Es una cosa entre chicas! Te puedo decir que todas me felicitaron por haber dejado atrás el pasado."
    kia "*Laugh* It's a girl thing! I can tell you that they all congratulated me on putting the past behind me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1966
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_86d4bac7:

    # kia "Algunas, aunque no te voy a decir quienes, me dieron consejos sobre ti."
    kia "Some of them, though I won't tell you who, gave me advice about you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1967
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_944522a8:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Eso es injusto! ¿Habláis de mi a mis espaldas?"
    mc "*Laugh* That's unfair! Are you talking about me behind my back?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1969
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_aafa9a2f:

    # kia "*Risa* Obviamente. Y duermo con [eil], que es quien más tiempo ha salido contigo."
    kia "*Laugh* Obviously. And I sleep in the same room as [eil], who has dated you the longest."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1970
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2505296a:

    # kia "Ya te dije que se pasó buena parte de la noche hablándome de ti e intentando convencerme para..."
    kia "I told you she spent most of the evening talking about you and trying to convince me to..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1971
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_03f9afb6:

    # mc "Tengo que hablar con ella. No es lo que quería decir cuando le pedía ayuda."
    mc "I should talk to her. That's not what I meant when I was asking her for help."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1973
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_14d72b5c:

    # kia "Sin su insistencia, no hubiéramos hablado anoche en el pasillo ni en la piscina, ni hubiéramos paseado después. Ni estaríamos aquí hoy."
    kia "Without her insistence, we wouldn't have talked last night in the hallway, or at the pool, or taken a walk afterwards. Nor would we be here today."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1974
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_333bdd8e:

    # kia "Ni podría hacer esto."
    kia "Nor could I do this."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1976
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_791a31f8:

    # "[kia] te sorprende con un beso en los labios. Tierno y pasional a partes iguales."
    "[kia] surprises you with a kiss on your lips. Tender and passionate in equal parts."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1977
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_21d044b8:

    # "No es muy largo, pero puedes leer muchas cosas en él. Alivio, felicidad, esperanza..."
    "It's not very long, but you can read a lot of things in it. Relief, happiness, hope..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1979
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c8dc03e3:

    # kia "Ya no aguantaba más."
    kia "I couldn't hold on any longer."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1980
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e60234c7:

    # mc "¡Wow!"
    mc "Wow!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1982
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a888af23:

    # kia "¿Quieres quitar esa sonrisa de tu cara? ¡La gente va a empezar a mirarnos!"
    kia "Can you wipe that smile off your face? People are going to start looking at us!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1983
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e60234c7_1:

    # mc "¡Wow!"
    mc "Wow!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1985
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8a485d4c:

    # kia "¡[mc], por favor! ¡Deja de hacer el tonto!"
    kia "[mc], please! Stop goofing around!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1986
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_42931d20:

    # mc "¡Wow! *Risa* Me acabo de enamorar del sabor de aguacate mezclado con tu pintalabios."
    mc "Wow! *Laugh* I just fell in love with the avocado flavor mixed with your lipstick."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1988
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d98ac0e5:

    # kia "*Risa* ¿Todavía tengo sabor a aguacate?"
    kia "*Laugh* Do I still taste like avocado?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1989
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b1b8b40a:

    # mc "Muy ligero, pero todavía se nota. *Risa* Creo que puedo añadir otra cosa verde al menú. Pero lo tendré que comer de tus labios."
    mc "Very slightly, but it's still noticeable. *Laugh* I think I may add another green thing to the menu. But I'll have to eat it from your lips."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1991
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6c92bb1c:

    # "La bibliotecaria pelirroja atrae tu cabeza hasta su altura y vuelve a besarte de una forma que las bibliotecarias deberían tener prohibida."
    "The red-haired librarian draws your head down to her lips and kisses you again in a way that librarians should be forbidden to do."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1992
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_24e1f98a:

    # "Esta vez es todo pasión, sin rastro de ternura. Pasea su lengua por tus encías, la entrelaza con la tuya, recorre toda tu boca... Te deja sin aliento."
    "This time it's all passion, without a trace of tenderness. She runs her tongue along your gums, entwines it with yours, roams your whole mouth... She takes your breath away."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1993
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_37461727:

    # "Bendito aguacate."
    "Blessed avocado."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1995
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e60234c7_2:

    # mc "¡Wow!"
    mc "Wow!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1996
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d5771a00:

    # kia "*Respiración entrecortada* ¡Wow! *Risa* Tenía que colaborar con que lleves una dieta saludable."
    kia "*Short breath* Wow! *Laugh* I just had to collaborate with you keeping a healthy diet."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1997
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0655365d:

    # kia "Me podría pasar horas aquí haciendo esto y diciendo Wow. Pero, desafortunadamente, tengo que volver al trabajo."
    kia "I could spend hours here doing this and saying, Wow! But unfortunately, I have to get back to work."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:1998
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_298eab58:

    # mc "Entonces vamos. No quiero que llegues tarde."
    mc "Then let's go. I don't want you to be late."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2000
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a05e80ee:

    # kia "Y tú has quedado con [ama]..."
    kia "And you have to meet with [ama]..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2001
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8fdac1cc:

    # mc "Sí, me quiere comentar sus ideas sobre la empresa."
    mc "Yes, she wants to talk about her ideas about the company."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2003
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ef05061a:

    # kia "*Risa* No estaba interrogándote. Sé que no estás con ella. Al menos aún..."
    kia "*Laugh* I wasn't interrogating you. I know you're not with her. At least not yet..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2004
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_d66fabe3:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo sé. Después de lo de ayer, no tengo secretos y no quiero tenerlos."
    mc "*Laugh* I know. After yesterday, I have no secrets, and I don't want to have any."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2005
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c6ec59ab:

    # mc "¿Vamos?"
    mc "Shall we go?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2007
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_b60c23b3:

    # "Unos minutos después, en la biblioteca, justo a la hora en que [kia] tenía que volver..."
    "A few minutes later, in the library, right at the time [kia] was due back..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2008
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8b2f8fdb:

    # kia "Ya estoy aquí, Gen. Puedes hacer tu pausa para la comida cuando quieras."
    kia "I'm here now, Gen. You can take your lunch break anytime."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2009
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1edb4e6e:

    # mc "Hola de nuevo, Gen."
    mc "Hello again, Gen."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2010
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_29a64304:

    # gen "Justo a tiempo, me estaba muriendo de hambre. La biblioteca está vacía, no queda nada pendiente."
    gen "Just in time, I was starving. The library is empty, there's nothing left pending."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2012
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a31f8e02:

    # kia "Pues el puesto de perritos calientes tiene bastante cola ahora. Si necesitas más tiempo no hay ningún problema."
    kia "Well, the hot dog stand has quite a queue right now. If you need more time, there's no problem."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2013
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0ed3ff23:

    # gen "[kia]... ¿dónde está tu bolso?"
    gen "[kia]... where's your purse?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2015
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_21ee7fe8:

    # kia "¡Mierda! Me lo he dejado en el restaurante."
    kia "Shit! I left it at the restaurant."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2017
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ee87a7da:

    # kia "¿Puedes cubrirme diez minutos mientras voy a buscarlo?"
    kia "Can you cover for me for ten minutes while I go get it?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2018
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_40554669:

    # gen "Ningún problema. Ve a ver si lo han encontrado antes de que desaparezca."
    gen "No problem. Go see if they've found it before it disappears."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2019
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_962e9524:

    # mc "No os preocupéis, voy a llamarles y voy a buscarlo, voy a llegar más rápido que tú con los tacones. Ahora lo traigo."
    mc "Don't worry, I'm going to call them and I'm going to get it. I'm going to get there faster than you in heels. I'll be back with the purse in a minute."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2020
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7d70251d:

    # mcp "(Espero que siga allí o que lo haya encontrado el camarero cuando nos hemos ido.)"
    mcp "(I hope it's still hanging on the chair or that the waiter found it when we left.)"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2022
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2a1b37fd:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc]. ¿Aviso a [ama] de que vas a llegar tarde?"
    kia "Thank you, [mc]. Do you want me to let [ama] know you're going to be late?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2023
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8b13deee:

    # mc "Sí, por favor."
    mc "Yes, please."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2025
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_82c139e0:

    # "Sales de la biblioteca y empiezas a correr hacia el restaurante mientras les llamas. No cogen el teléfono."
    "You leave the library and start running to the restaurant while calling them. They don't pick up the phone."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2026
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_28f6b659:

    # "Llegas un par de minutos después. Nunca habías corrido tan rápido en tu vida."
    "You arrive there a couple of minutes later. You've never run so fast in your life."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2028
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ddd4ef24:

    # "El camarero saca el bolso de la barra antes de que puedas recuperar el aliento para pedírselo."
    "The waiter pulls the purse off the counter before you can catch your breath to ask him for it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2029
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_61bec498:

    # "Hubiera sido una forma horrible de acabar la segunda cita si [kia] hubiera perdido el bolso."
    "It would have been a horrible way to end the second date, if [kia] would have lost the purse."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2031
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f8948cde:

    # "Vuelves corriendo a la biblioteca. No quieres que [kia] se preocupe por su bolso más de lo necesario. Corres un poco más lento."
    "You run back to the library. You don't want [kia] to worry about her purse any more than necessary. You run a little slower."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2032
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7ec444f4:

    # "Quieres mantener un poco de dignidad cuando llegues, y fregar la biblioteca con la lengua no es la mejor forma de hacerlo."
    "You want to keep a little dignity when you arrive, and mopping the library with your tongue is not the best way to do that."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2034
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_41e727be:

    # "Cuando estás a punto de entrar, oyes voces..."
    "When you're about to enter, you hear voices too loud for two librarians..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2035
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_12932815:

    # kia "...¡Me da lo mismo que tenga edad para ser mi hijo!"
    kia "...I don't care if he's my daughter's age!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2036
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a9cc36f2:

    # gen "[kia], lo digo por tu bien. Los chavales como él sólo quieren una cosa en una mujer de tu edad..."
    gen "[kia], I'm saying this for your sake. Guys like him only want one thing in a woman your age..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2037
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5751ce07:

    # kia "Él es diferente..."
    kia "He's different..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2038
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_31d65093:

    # gen "Si supieras las veces que he oído eso..."
    gen "If you knew how many times I heard that..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2039
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f46409ae:

    # mcp "(Es el momento de intervenir.)"
    mcp "(It's time for me to intervene.)"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2041
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a641d824:

    # mc "Hola, [kia], Sra. Sky. Vengo con el bolso. Lo había recogido el camarero en cuanto nos hemos ido."
    mc "Hello, [kia], Mrs. Sky. I'm back with your purse. The waiter picked it up as soon as we left."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2042
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_0d7b308b:

    # kia "¡Gracias a Dios!"
    kia "Thank God!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2043
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5e5e2a04:

    # gen "Gracias, [mc]. [kia] estaba muy preocupada. Y puedes seguir llamándome Gen..."
    gen "Thank you, [mc]. [kia] was really worried. And you can keep calling me Gen..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2045
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ef1dcc07:

    # "Ignoras a Geneviève y te arrodillas a los pies de [kia], poniendo el bolso en el suelo."
    "You ignore Geneviève and kneel at [kia]'s feet, putting the purse on the floor."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2047
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_3c0703f5:

    # kia "¿Qué haces, [mc]?"
    kia "What are you doing, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2048
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_51b3fcab:

    # mc "He oído como la Sra. Sky decía que los chavales como yo sólo queremos una cosa con mujeres como tú."
    mc "I heard how Mrs. Sky was saying that guys like me only want one thing with women like you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2050
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_2d0d83f0:

    # mc "No sé lo que quieren otros chavales como yo."
    mc "I don't know what other guys like me want."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2052
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6e1b5cf3:

    # mc "Yo lo único que quiero es poner el mundo a tus pies, [kia]. Empiezo con un bolso."
    mc "All I want to do is put the world at your feet, [kia]. I start with a handbag."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2053
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6b53cf56:

    # mc "Y también quiero callar a quien opina sobre nosotros sin saber nada sobre lo que hemos pasado."
    mc "And I also want to shut up those who give their opinion about us without knowing anything about what we have been through."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2054
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_c3f1b5be:

    # kia "Gracias, [mc], pero... ¿puedes levantarte?"
    kia "Thank you, [mc], but... can you stand up?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2057
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8ee06496:

    # "Estás enfadado. Mucho. Sabes que tus relaciones pueden hacer que se levante más de una ceja. Pero no estabas preparado para esto."
    "You are angry. Very angry. You know your relationships can raise more than one eyebrow. But you weren't ready for this."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2059
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5c20a138:

    # "Estás enfadado. Mucho. Sabes que tu relación con [kia] puede hacer que se levante más de una ceja. Pero no estabas preparado para esto."
    "You are angry. Very angry. You know your relationship with [kia] can raise more than one eyebrow. But you weren't ready for this."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2060
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_83eb79b0:

    # mc "¿Has podido llamar a [ama]?"
    mc "Did you get a chance to call [ama]?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2061
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_ecb11950:

    # kia "Mi móvil estaba en el bolso... ni siquiera he pensado en ello, y no me he aprendido su número."
    kia "My phone was in my purse... I didn't even think about it, and I didn't memorize her number."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2062
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_7d61ae16:

    # mc "Entonces no te preocupes. Aún llego a tiempo."
    mc "Then don't worry. I'm still on time."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2064
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_45d03ede:

    # gen "Siento si te he ofendido, [mc]. Sólo intentaba proteger a [kia]."
    gen "I'm sorry if I offended you, [mc]. I was just trying to protect [kia]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2065
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4ab0c2c3:

    # "Está nerviosa. Sabe que ha metido la pata. Se le nota más aún el acento francés."
    "She's nervous. She knows she screwed up. Her French accent is even more noticeable."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2066
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_4bed652a:

    # mc "Me parece loable, pero debería informarse sobre lo que habla antes de decir algo de lo que pueda arrepentirse, Sra. Sky."
    mc "I think it's commendable, but you should learn about what you're talking about before you say something you might regret, Mrs. Sky."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2067
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6547ca29:

    # "Tu tono es cortante. Ahora mismo no quieres dar explicaciones ni hablar con esta mujer."
    "Your voice is curt. Right now, you don't want to explain yourself or talk to that woman."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2068
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9e5bf2a2:

    # gen "Gen..."
    gen "Gen..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2069
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_557ac246:

    # mc "Sólo acorto los nombres de mis amigos, Geneviève."
    mc "I only shorten the names of my friends, Geneviève."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2071
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_56a4311f:

    # "Dulcificas tu tono cuando te diriges a [kia]."
    "You sweeten your voice when you address [kia]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2072
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_47c19fca:

    # mc "Voy a ir a lo de [ama] antes de que se haga tarde."
    mc "I'm going to go to [ama]'s appointment before it gets late."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2073
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_1ac8e5cc:

    # kia "Gracias de nuevo, [mc]."
    kia "Thank you again, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2074
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8b0e91b1:

    # mc "Te veo en casa, cielo."
    mc "See you at home, honey."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2076
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_da634e8e:

    # kia "Espera un momento..."
    kia "Wait a minute..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2077
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5c6b8bd7:

    # mc "¿Falta algo en el bolso?"
    mc "Is anything missing from the purse?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2078
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_da7da0b6:

    # kia "Ni lo sé ni me importa."
    kia "I neither know nor care."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2079
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9493c8fc:

    # "El bolso continúa en el suelo, donde los has dejado."
    "The handbag is still on the floor, where you left it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2081
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_6a149303:

    # "[kia] se lanza a tus labios para sorpresa tuya y de Geneviève. Tú has defendido vuestra relación a tu manera."
    "[kia] throws herself at your lips to your and Geneviève's surprise. You have defended your relationship in your own way."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2082
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_5781450e:

    # "Ella la defiende a la suya."
    "Now she defends it in her own fashion."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2083
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_f42e6c2d:

    # "Demostrándole a Geneviève que sus palabras no han conseguido sembrar ninguna duda."
    "Proving to Geneviève that her words have not succeeded in sowing any doubt."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2084
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_8800b7ec:

    # "También te lo quiere demostrar a ti."
    "She wants to prove it to you, too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2085
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_319ad8f0:

    # "Todavía sabe a aguacate."
    "She still tastes like avocado."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2087
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e03f835c:

    # kia "¡Wow! *Risa*"
    kia "Wow! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2088
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_9a736d83:

    # mc "¡Wow! *Risa*"
    mc "Wow! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2090
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_a7d06318:

    # kia "Gracias por todo, cielo."
    kia "Thank you for everything, honey."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2091
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_01b1a236:

    # "Ese \"por todo\" incluye dar la cara por ella. Quizás por primera vez en su vida alguien lo ha hecho."
    "That \"everything\" includes standing up for her. Maybe for the first time in her life someone has done it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2092
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e2d67541:

    # mc "Te veo en casa, preciosa."
    mc "See you at home, gorgeous."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2094
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_54905dfa:

    # mc "Adiós, Geneviève."
    mc "Goodbye, Geneviève."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2095
translate english c21s003_KiaraDate_e5568ef5:

    # "Te marchas mientras escuchas la despedida murmurada de Geneviève."
    "You leave as you listen to Geneviève's mumbled farewell."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2107
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_73df7f5a:

    # "Llegas al café donde has quedado con [ama]. Era un sitio que no habías visitado nunca anteriormente, pero has venido varias veces en las últimas semanas."
    "You arrive at the cafe where you are meeting [ama]. It was a place you had never visited before, but you have come several times in the last few weeks."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2108
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_142dc0f7:

    # "[ama] ya está allí, con un café y un portátil sobre la mesa."
    "[ama] is already there, with a coffee and a laptop on the table."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2110
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_db15f581:

    # mc "Hola, [ama]. No te levantes. ¿Llevas mucho esperando? No llego tarde, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Hello, [ama]. Don't get up, have you been waiting long? I'm not late, am I?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2111
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_5e28640c:

    # ama "No te preocupes, llevo diez minutos aquí tan solo. He llegado antes de la hora. Y tú llegas super puntual."
    ama "Don't worry, I've been here for only ten minutes. I've been here ahead of time. And you're just on time."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2112
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_ed741d2f:

    # mc "Nunca me ha parecido bien hacer esperar a nadie. Lo considero una falta de respeto hacia el tiempo de los demás."
    mc "It has never seemed right to me to keep anyone waiting. I consider it disrespectful of other people's time."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2114
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4a9e8483:

    # ama "No sé cómo lo consigues. Los civiles tenéis unas vidas muy complicadas con un montón de cosas por hacer que se solapan."
    ama "I don't know how you get it done. You civilians have such complicated lives with a lot of overlapping things to do."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2116
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_30339c94:

    # ama "Casi echo de menos la vida organizada de la base en la que siempre sabes qué tienes que hacer a qué hora. Solo casi."
    ama "I almost miss the organized life of the base, where you always know what you have to do at what time. Almost."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2117
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_1043c8a0:

    # mc "Yo estoy pensando en fichar una secretaria. *Risa*"
    mc "I'm thinking of hiring an assistant. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2119
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6f095e24:

    # ama "¿Más mujeres a tu alrededor? *Risa* ¿No tienes suficientes?"
    ama "More women around you? *Laugh* Don't you have enough?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2120
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_1759b4a8:

    # mc "*Risa* Estaba pensando en fichar a Meemaw para eso. *Risa* Al menos se mantendría activa y se sentiría útil."
    mc "*Laugh* I was thinking of signing Meemaw up for that. *Laugh* At least she'd stay active and feel useful."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2121
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_8c8428b9:

    # mc "Además, evitaría tener que informar a más personas de los secretos familiares."
    mc "Plus, it would avoid having to inform more people about the family secrets."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2123
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a0fef5fc:

    # ama "Los secretos parece que van a dejar de serlos. He hablado con [aar] esta mañana. ¿Ha conseguido contactar contigo?"
    ama "It looks like some secrets are going to stop being a secret. I talked to [aar] this morning. Did he manage to get in touch with you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2124
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_7ff06615:

    # mc "Sí, hemos estado hablando sobre la compañía que quiere comprar NTR... ¿Iron Fist se llamaban?"
    mc "Yes, we've been talking about the company that wants to buy NTR... Iron Fist was their name, right?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2126
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f7182efb:

    # ama "Sí, son unos capullos, aunque efectivos."
    ama "Yes, they're assholes, albeit effective ones."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2127
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_8b2a1015:

    # ama "Su concepto de operaciones encubiertas es que si no hay supervivientes nadie puede informar. Tienen la sutileza de un ariete... o de [emm]."
    ama "Their concept of covert operations is, if there are no survivors, no one can report it. They have the subtlety of a battering ram... or [emm]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2128
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a53a432a:

    # mc "*Risa* No es la primera vez que comparan la sutileza de [emm] con un ariete."
    mc "*Laugh* It's not the first time someone compared [emm]'s subtlety to a battering ram."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2129
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_82069f6e:

    # mc "Pero hablando de Iron Fist, tienen que ser enormes si pueden pagar los nueve o diez dígitos que [aar] dijo que valía NTR."
    mc "But speaking of Iron Fist, they have to be huge if they can afford the nine or ten digits that [aar] said NTR was worth."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2131
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_136c728f:

    # ama "No, no lo son. Son grandes, pero más pequeños que nosotros. Quieren aprovechar el vacío de poder para comprar NTR por una fracción de su valor."
    ama "No, they are not. They are big, but smaller than us. They want to take advantage of the power vacuum to buy NTR for a fraction of its value."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2132
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_ae964a75:

    # ama "Comprarnos casi triplicaría su cifra de negocio y les proporcionaría contratos a los que no tienen acceso ahora mismo."
    ama "Buying us would almost triple their turnover and give them contracts they don't have access to right now."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2133
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4929bee7:

    # ama "Su negocio de operaciones especiales es algo menos de la mitad del nuestro. Y estamos hablando de cientos de millones."
    ama "Their special operations business is a little less than half of ours. We're talking in the hundreds of millions."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2134
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_2e7db18d:

    # mc "Eso es un montón de dinero. ¿Tantas operaciones especiales se hacen?"
    mc "That's a lot of money. How many special operations are done yearly?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2136
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a148b45a:

    # ama "Se hacen muchas. Y son caras. Iron Fist trabaja mucho con los gobiernos de países que Estados Unidos no considera amigables."
    ama "We work in a lot of them. And they're expensive. Iron Fist does a lot of work with governments of countries the U.S. doesn't consider friendly."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2137
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_19c56fe5:

    # ama "Por eso no tienen acceso a algunos contratos."
    ama "That's why they don't have access to some contracts."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2139
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_54f98cb9:

    # ama "Los clientes principales de NTR son precisamente Estados Unidos y otros países occidentales que no se quieren manchar las manos haciendo algunas cosas."
    ama "NTR's main customers are precisely the United States and other Western countries that don't want to get their hands dirty doing certain things."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2140
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_0c7e8fb7:

    # ama "Pagan MUY bien por evitar salir en la prensa si algo sale mal."
    ama "They pay VERY well to avoid getting in the press if something goes wrong."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2141
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_01b2a114:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Como una misión en Burkina Faso donde envían a dos niñas de 14 años. Quedaría mal en la prensa si se emborrachan."
    mc "I get it. Like a mission in Burkina Faso where they sent two 14-year-old girls. It would look bad in the press if they got drunk."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2143
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6298a0d4:

    # ama "Sí, a eso me refiero. Esa misión no la podían hacer los Navy SEAL. *Risa* Y no solo porque Burkina no tenga mar."
    ama "Yes, that's what I mean. That mission couldn't be done by the Navy SEALs. *Laugh* And not just because Burkina is landlocked."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2144
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_2534901f:

    # ama "Y por eso quería hablar contigo sobre el futuro de NTR. He hecho algunos números con la información que me ha enviado [aar]..."
    ama "And that's why I wanted to talk to you about the future of NTR. I've crunched some numbers with the information [aar] sent me..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2145
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_98fe2261:

    # mc "Déjame pedir un café y me lo explicas."
    mc "Let me order a coffee and you can explain it to me."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2147
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_86475cc1:

    # "[ama] pasa unos 20 minutos explicándote la situación del negocio, hasta que llega a la parte más interesante. El dinero."
    "[ama] spends about 20 minutes explaining the business situation to you, until she gets to the most interesting part. The money."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2149
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_472a8405:

    # ama "La parte médica de la compañía es el 12%% de la facturación global de NTR. El 71%% de la facturación proviene de operaciones de Seguridad."
    ama "The medical part of the company is 12\% of NTR's global turnover. 71\% of the turnover comes from Security Operations."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2150
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6b6de5d5:

    # ama "Puedes ver aquí la mala noticia. La parte médica es la que menos dinero da. Es imposible basar la compañía sólo en eso ahora mismo."
    ama "You can see the bad news here. The medical part is the part that makes the least money. Right now, it's impossible to base the company on that area."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2151
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_1ada89a7:

    # mc "¿Qué es ese concepto? ¿Servicios de Apoyo?"
    mc "What is this concept? Support Services?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2153
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4f41ba3a:

    # ama "Alquiler de Equipos y Soporte Logístico, básicamente. A otras compañías como NTR, pero más pequeñas. Transporte de operativos, alquiler de equipos, etc."
    ama "Equipment Rental and Logistical Support, basically. To other companies like NTR, but smaller. Transportation of operatives, leasing of equipment, etc."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2154
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c15671a1:

    # mc "¿Podríamos mantener esa parte de la Compañía? No nos involucraríamos en Operaciones Especiales con eso, ¿no?"
    mc "Could we keep that part of the Company? We wouldn't get involved in Special Ops with that, would we?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2156
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_0e46556c:

    # ama "Déjame mirar una cosa..."
    ama "Let me check some numbers..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2157
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_467f4d49:

    # ama "No sería difícil de hacer. Tenemos los contactos y, si dejamos de ser su competencia, otras compañías podrían requerir nuestros servicios."
    ama "It wouldn't be hard to do. We have the contacts and, if we stopped being their competition, other companies might require our services."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2159
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e03e8c16:

    # ama "Bien pensado, pero habría que estudiarlo bien. Y no, no nos involucramos en las operaciones de otras compañías. Solo les damos apoyo."
    ama "Good thinking, but it would have to be studied well. And no, we don't get involved in other companies' operations. We just support them."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2160
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_992f61f5:

    # mc "Dale trabajo a [aar]. *Risa* Creo que, de momento, sería bueno mantener esa fuente de ingresos."
    mc "Give [aar] some work. *Laugh* I think, for the time being, it would be good to keep that source of income."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2161
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_bc05e904:

    # mc "Has dicho que es la mala noticia. ¿Hay una buena?"
    mc "You said it's the bad news. Is there any good news?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2163
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_5d5c4dac:

    # ama "Sí, esta. Y con lo que acabas de decir de mantener los Servicios de Apoyo, es incluso mejor."
    ama "Yes, this one. And with what you just said about keeping Support Services, it's even better."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2164
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_b76726e1:

    # ama "La facturación crece en las tres áreas cada año, pero el crecimiento en el área de Seguridad es casi residual, entre un 2%% y un 5%%."
    ama "Turnover grows in all three areas every year, but growth in the Security area is almost residual, between 2\% and 5\%. We don't have enough operatives to grow more."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2165
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c9bfcae3:

    # ama "El crecimiento en los Servicios de Apoyo es de entre un 15%% y un 18%% anual."
    ama "Growth in Support Services is between 15\% and 18\% per year."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2166
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_5ac46d50:

    # mc "Eso es una barbaridad de crecimiento."
    mc "Wow! That's an outrageous amount of growth."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2168
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f4f742b4:

    # ama "La facturación de la parte médica crece entre el 50%% y el 60%%. Y acelerando. Hemos empezado muy abajo y es fácil crecer."
    ama "The growth of the medical part is even better. It grows between 50\% and 60\%. And accelerating. We started small and it's easier to grow."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2169
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_b400262a:

    # ama "Es la partida más pequeña, pero el año que viene seguramente superará a los Servicios de Apoyo."
    ama "It's the smallest business area, but next year it could surpass Support Services at this rate."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2170
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_0bbcecef:

    # mc "Déjame hacer unos cálculos..."
    mc "Let me do some calculations..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2172
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_72a4dfa7:

    # mc "En cinco años, con ese ritmo de crecimiento, podría ser la principal área de negocio."
    mc "In five years, with this growth rate, it could be the main business area. Although growth will surely slow down at some point."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2173
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6a6d173c:

    # ama "Y en dos años, combinada con los Servicios de Apoyo, superarían al área de Seguridad. Yo también he hecho los cálculos."
    ama "In two years, combined with Support Services, they could surpass the Security area. I've done the math, too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2175
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e0adb9a3:

    # "[ama] pasa los siguientes minutos explicándote todos los cálculos que ha hecho y cómo su plan puede ser realizable."
    "[ama] spends the next few minutes explaining to you all the calculations she made and how her plan may be achievable."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2176
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_27e2028b:

    # "A veces tiene que parar para hacer algún cálculo nuevo debido a la posibilidad de mantener los Servicios de Apoyo."
    "Sometimes you have to stop to do some new calculations because of the possibility of retaining the Support Services area."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2177
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_cf440c51:

    # "Son cálculos que aburrirían a cualquiera que no fuera un empollón. Por suerte ambos lo sois."
    "These are calculations that would bore anyone who wasn't a nerd. Luckily, you both have a nerdy streak."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2179
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_36ef2119:

    # ama "Y eso sería todo. Creo que, económicamente, el plan es realizable."
    ama "And that would be it. I think, financially, the plan is doable."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2180
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_44943cd0:

    # mc "Le veo un problema. ¿Qué hacemos con vosotras? ¿Y con los XY?"
    mc "I see a problem. What do we do with you? What about the XY?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2182
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a5795415:

    # ama "También he pensado en eso, pero necesito modificarlo."
    ama "I've thought about that too, but I need to modify it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2183
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e53d4110:

    # ama "No estoy segura de que todos los XY quieran abandonar la vida que llevan. Las misiones dan mucha adrenalina, son como una droga."
    ama "I'm not sure all XY people want to give up the life they lead. Missions give you a lot of adrenaline, they're like a drug."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2184
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e342d899:

    # mc "Pero vosotras sí que queréis dejar esas misiones."
    mc "But you two really want to stop doing those missions."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2186
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_10dcc7de:

    # ama "Nosotras somos diferentes. Envejecemos a un ritmo normal. Ellos saben que tienen una juventud limitada y querrán sacarle el máximo partido."
    ama "We are different. We age at a normal rate. They know they have limited youth and will want to make the most of it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2187
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_55c23b04:

    # ama "[eva] y yo nos conformaríamos con un trabajo normal."
    ama "[eva] and I would settle for a \"regular\" job. One where we could use our skills, but without having to do... some of the nastier things."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2188
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_dda27f5f:

    # mc "¿Como jefas de seguridad de la base, por ejemplo? Había pensado en eso como opción. En el fondo, la empresa también es vuestra."
    mc "As NTR Security Managers, for example? I had thought of that as an option. At the end of the day, the company is yours, too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2190
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_99e64c93:

    # ama "¿Qué? ¡No! ¿Por qué quieres hacernos esto?"
    ama "What? No! Why do you want to do this to us?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2191
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_44b2bddf:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Haceros qué?"
    mc "Huh? Do what to you? I don't understand."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2193
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4254531d:

    # ama "¡Mandarnos lejos!"
    ama "Send us far away!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2194
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_7e3a8c72:

    # ama "¡Os acabamos de encontrar!"
    ama "We just found a family!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2196
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3a65f1d9:

    # ama "¡[eva] y yo incluso hemos resuelto nuestras diferencias respecto a ti!"
    ama "[eva] and I even settled our differences about you!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2197
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_1024c403:

    # mc "No os quiero mandar lejos, [ama]. Yo también voy a ir a Aruba."
    mc "I don't want to send you away, [ama]. I'm going to Aruba, too."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2199
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_44557789:

    # ama "Pero tu volverás... y nosotras, si somos las jefas de seguridad, nos tendremos que quedar allí..."
    ama "But you will return... and we, if we are the Security Managers, we will have to stay there... And the girls will be here..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2212
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_532effae:

    # mc "También necesitaremos a alguien que proteja a los accionistas, ¿no?"
    mc "We'll also need someone to protect the shareholders, won't we? *Wink*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2213
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_87cbbccf:

    # mc "Y no se me ocurre nadie mejor que vosotras. Podéis turnaros, no sé... ¿Una semana cada una en Aruba mientras la otra está aquí con la familia?"
    mc "And I can't think of anyone better than you. You can take turns, I don't know... A week in Aruba while [eva] is here with the family, and then you can switch?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2216
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_fb44ec1f:

    # ama "Espera... has dicho que me quieres cerca de ti... ¿Significa eso que...?"
    ama "Wait... you said you want me near you... Does that mean...?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2217
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c1ad7533:

    # mc "Sí, [ama]. Significa que, si quieres, me encantaría salir contigo."
    mc "Yes, [ama]. It means that, if you want, I'd love to have a date with you. And this doesn't count."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2218
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_ffd67f7e:

    # mc "Sólo estaba esperando a que [eva] y tú aclararais las cosas para decírtelo."
    mc "I was just waiting for you and [eva] to clear things up before I told you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2220
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_79933eac:

    # ama "¿Decírmelo? ¿Sólo a mí? ¿No quieres estar con [eva]?"
    ama "Tell me? Just me? Don't you want to be with [eva] also?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2221
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f87257ab:

    # mc "Eso es algo que [eva] y yo tenemos que hablar. A solas. Los dos. Independientemente de si quiero estar con ella o no."
    mc "That's something [eva] and I need to talk about. Alone. Both of us. Regardless of whether I want to be with her or not."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2222
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_0d111a06:

    # ama "Lo entiendo..."
    ama "I understand..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2224
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_bb3a07dc:

    # ama "¿Significa eso que... puedo besarte?"
    ama "Does that mean... I can kiss you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2225
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4b26efe4:

    # mc "No, significa que ahora vamos a tirar las tazas al suelo y vamos a follar encima de la mesa. *Risa*"
    mc "No, it means that we're going to throw the cups on the floor now, and we will fuck on top of the table. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2227
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_08e8d48b:

    # ama "¿Qué? ¿Ahora? ¿Aquí?"
    ama "What? Now? Here? Are you sure?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2228
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f67c14de:

    # mc "*Risa* Tenemos que trabajar en tu detección del sarcasmo."
    mc "*Laugh* We need to work on your sarcasm detection."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2230
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e0b1a77f:

    # mc "Claro que vamos a besarnos. ¿Me permites?"
    mc "Of course we're going to kiss. May I?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2233
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a122784e:

    # "[ama] se levanta como impulsada por un muelle y ataca tus labios con furia."
    "[ama] rises as if impelled by a spring and attacks your lips with fury."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2234
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_97e8eb5a:

    # "\"Atacar\" es la palabra adecuada."
    "\"Attack\" is the right word."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2235
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_36b607be:

    # "Hay furia y pasión en su beso. Creías que iba a ser un beso tímido, pero no podías estar más equivocado."
    "There is fury and passion in her kiss. You thought it was going to be a shy kiss, but you couldn't have been more wrong."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2236
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e5708729:

    # "Sólo se separa de tus labios cuando le falta el aire."
    "She only breaks away from your lips when she's short of breath."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2239
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e8e43958:

    # ama "¡Wow!"
    ama "Amazing!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2240
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_08f7d3ff:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy de acuerdo. ¡Wow!"
    mc "*Laugh* I agree. Amazing!"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2242
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c89321d1:

    # ama "*Risa* No te rías de mí. Llevo días queriendo hacer esto..."
    ama "*Laugh* Don't laugh at me. I've been wanting to do this for days..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2244
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_21ef5df9:

    # ama "¿Sabes cuando quieres algo durante mucho tiempo y lo consigues...? ¿Ese sentimiento de decepción? ¿De vacío al cumplir el objetivo?"
    ama "You know when you want something for a long time... and you get it... That feeling of disappointment? Of emptiness when you accomplish the goal?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2245
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_d5415aec:

    # mc "Sí, conozco ese sentimiento. ¿Decepcionada?"
    mc "Yes, I know that feeling. Disappointed?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2247
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f6769de9:

    # ama "*Risa* Tenemos que trabajar en tu costumbre de interrumpir a la gente cuando habla."
    ama "*Laugh* We need to work on your habit of interrupting people when they are talking."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2248
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6eb8b13a:

    # ama "Quería decir que esperaba ese sentimiento, pero no se ha dado. *Risa* Al revés. Tengo ganas de ignorar tu sarcasmo y tirar las tazas al suelo."
    ama "I wanted to say that I was expecting that feeling, but it didn't happen. *Laugh* Just the contrary. I feel like ignoring your sarcasm and throwing the cups on the floor to free up the table."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2249
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_2612622a:

    # mc "*Risa* Tengo que ser una bestia besando."
    mc "*Laugh* I must be a beast at kissing."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2251
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a565ca82:

    # ama "*Risa* No voy a decir ni que sí ni que no. No quiero alimentar tu ego más de lo que ya lo está."
    ama "*Laugh* I'm not going to say yes or no. I don't want to feed your ego any more than it already is."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2253
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6c486a00:

    # "Te da un rápido beso."
    "She gives you a quick kiss."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2254
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_69881554:

    # ama "Siéntate donde estabas, voy al lavabo un momento y seguimos con la reunión."
    ama "Sit where you were, I'm going to the restroom for a moment and we'll continue with the meeting."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2255
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3e89e8ed:

    # mc "¿No quieres que me siente a tu lado?"
    mc "Don't you want me to sit next to you?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2256
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3d50c3d3:

    # ama "Sí, pero si lo haces no vamos a poder acabar con lo que hemos venido a hacer. Si hay una mesa entre los dos puedo mantener la cabeza centrada en la reunión."
    ama "Yes, but, if you do, we won't be able to finish what we came here to do. If there's a table between the two of us, I can at least keep my head focused on the meeting."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2258
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_412cc044:

    # ama "Más o menos."
    ama "More or less."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2261
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_23c48176:

    # ama "Espera... Has dicho que quieres que forme parte de la familia, pero no has dicho nada de nosotros."
    ama "Wait... You've said you want me to be part of the family, but you haven't said anything about us."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2262
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3289a10b:

    # ama "¿Significa eso que tú y yo...?"
    ama "Does that mean that you and I...?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2263
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_d27eeaf8:

    # mc "Significa que quiero que formes parte de nuestras vidas. Me caes muy bien, [ama], pero a diferencia de ti, te conozco tan solo desde hace unos días."
    mc "It means I want you to be part of our lives. I like you very much, [ama], but unlike you, I've only known you for a few days."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2265
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_eb151802:

    # mc "No he tenido tiempo de desarrollar sentimientos por ti, y... no creo que lo haga en el futuro. Al menos no como tú quieres."
    mc "I haven't had the time to develop feelings for you, and... I don't think I will in the foreseeable future. At least not the way you want me to."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2266
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c6d41377:

    # mc "Despiertas en mí un sentimiento de protección, pero no uno romántico."
    mc "You awaken a protective feeling in me, but not a romantic one."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2267
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_59e887db:

    # mc "No quiero darte falsas esperanzas. Creo que tengo que ser sincero sobre eso."
    mc "I don't want to give you false hope. I think I have to be honest about that."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2268
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a242232e:

    # mc "Que [eva] y tú hayáis tardado tanto en resolver vuestras diferencias, me ha dado tiempo a mí para examinar lo que siento hacia vosotras."
    mc "[eva] and you taking so long to resolve your differences allowed me enough time to examine how I feel about you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2270
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f63e1d87:

    # ama "Lo entiendo y te agradezco la sinceridad..."
    ama "I understand and I thank you for your honesty..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2271
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_6c772ee3:

    # ama "¿Te pasa lo mismo con [eva]? No sé si te va a arrancar la cabeza si le dices algo así."
    ama "Is it the same with [eva]? I don't know if she's going to rip your head off if you say something like that to her."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2272
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f87257ab_1:

    # mc "Eso es algo que [eva] y yo tenemos que hablar. A solas. Los dos. Independientemente de si quiero estar con ella o no."
    mc "That's something [eva] and I need to talk about. Alone. Both of us. Regardless of whether I want to be with her or not."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2274
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_5d7ed353:

    # ama "Tienes razón, no debería inmiscuirme."
    ama "You're right, I shouldn't meddle."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2275
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_4a3807a0:

    # ama "Dame un segundo, voy al lavabo."
    ama "Give me a second, I'm going to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2276
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3c72afc8:

    # mc "El tiempo que necesites."
    mc "Take as long as you need."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2278
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "A few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2279
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_11e8caa8:

    # ama "Volviendo al tema de los XY..."
    ama "Getting back to the XY topic..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2280
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_2bc208ce:

    # mc "¿No quieres hablar de lo que acaba de pasar?"
    mc "Don't you want to talk about what just happened?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2282
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_2e791067:

    # ama "Prefiero no hacerlo ahora. Tenemos que acabar esto y tengo que relevar a [eva]."
    ama "I'd rather not do it now. We have to finish this, and then I need to relieve [eva]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2284
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_434b87cf:

    # ama "Si empiezo a hablar de lo que ha pasado, no vamos a parar y voy a pasarme horas besándote."
    ama "If I start talking about what happened, we're not going to stop and I'm going to spend hours kissing you."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2285
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_38c8e290:

    # ama "Tendremos mucho tiempo para hablar cuando llegue el momento. Ahora tenemos una reunión que terminar."
    ama "We'll have plenty of time to talk when the time comes. Right now, we have a meeting to finish."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2287
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_13d3336d:

    # ama "No tiene sentido hablarlo. Sentimos cosas diferentes por el otro, pero ni quiero ni puedo forzarte a sentir lo que siento yo."
    ama "There's no point in talking about it. We feel differently towards each other, but I neither want to nor can I force you to feel what I feel."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2288
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_815b5864:

    # ama "No me debes ninguna explicación ni yo la quiero, pero tenemos una reunión que terminar."
    ama "You don't owe me any explanation nor do I want one, but we have a meeting to finish."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2289
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_3aff1176:

    # mc "De acuerdo, sigamos entonces."
    mc "All right, let's go on then."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2291
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_87d6d455:

    # ama "Contamos con 109 efectivos XY operativos ahora mismo. Aparte de eso hay 19 inoperativos."
    ama "We have 109 operational XY troopers right now. Other than that, there are 19 inoperative. Mostly injured."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2292
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_b23bbd8c:

    # ama "En los próximos diez años, 461 más completarán su crecimiento y formación."
    ama "Over the next ten years, 461 more will complete their growth and training."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2293
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_29bf8ed0:

    # mcp "(Acaba de aparecer la [ama] fría y profesional para separarse emocionalmente de lo que acaba de pasar.)"
    mcp "(Cold, professional [ama] has just appeared to detach herself emotionally from what just happened.)"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2295
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_aa1e9894:

    # ama "Como ya te he dicho, si les damos opciones, no todos van a querer abandonar las Operaciones Especiales."
    ama "As I told you, if we give them options, not everyone is going to want to stop working on Special Ops."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2296
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_b86fa212:

    # ama "Pero podremos reubicar a la mayoría en operaciones de Apoyo o en seguridad de la base, especialmente a los nuevos."
    ama "But we will be able to redeploy most of them to Support Services or base security, especially the new ones."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2297
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_e578e9b6:

    # mc "Creo que tenemos que darles la opción de decidir. Tienen tanto derecho como tú o como yo."
    mc "I think we have to give them the freedom to choose. They have as much right as you or I do."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2298
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a917d171:

    # mc "Incluso si quieren desvincularse totalmente de NTR deberíamos aceptarlo."
    mc "Even if they want to totally disassociate themselves from NTR we should accept it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2299
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_843a0f18:

    # mc "¿Cuánta seguridad necesitamos en la base?"
    mc "How much security do we need at the base?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2301
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_7824fc7a:

    # ama "Ahora mismo hay 36 en tres turnos. Casi todos de las Series J y K, la última y la próxima en ser considerada operativa. Les sirve como entrenamiento."
    ama "Right now, there are 36 in three shifts. Almost all from the J and K Series, the last and next to be considered operational. It serves them as training."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2303
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c2659771:

    # ama "Aquí puedes ver las estadísticas por series. De la K a la T todavía están en crecimiento y formación."
    ama "Here you can see the statistics by series. K through T are still growing and training."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2304
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_42975966:

    # mc "Hay mucho rojo, incluso entre las series que no han entrado en servicio. Demasiado rojo."
    mc "There is a lot of red, even among the series that have not entered service. Too much red."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2305
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_deb35d10:

    # ama "Alrededor del 7%% son bajas durante el entrenamiento, como Fiona. El resto son bajas operativas. Sumadas al entrenamiento, alrededor del 32%% son bajas."
    ama "About 7\% are training casualties, such as Fiona. The rest are operational casualties. Added to training, around 32\% are casualties."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2306
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_d26ea785:

    # mc "Si seguimos con el entrenamiento, hay que cambiar los métodos. No quiero que niños pequeños mueran jugando con explosivos."
    mc "If we continue with the training, we have to change the methodologies. I don't want young children to die playing with explosives."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2307
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_5f5b1891:

    # mc "Y me da lo mismo que tengan cuerpos de adultos. No quiero. Punto."
    mc "And I don't care if they have adult bodies. I don't want it. Period."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2309
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a5965deb:

    # ama "Me sorprende la empatía que tienes hacia gente que no conoces."
    ama "I'm amazed at the empathy you show for people you have never met."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2310
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_dede75a0:

    # mc "Os conozco a [eva] y a ti. Y a [aar], aunque sea poco. Tengo suficiente."
    mc "I've met [eva] and you. And [aar], even if it was only for an hour. I have enough to want to finish it."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2311
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_d91b722c:

    # mc "¿Quién se encarga del entrenamiento ahora mismo?"
    mc "Who is in charge of training right now?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2313
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_949531d5:

    # ama "Los C y los D, principalmente. Los entrenan como fueron entrenados ellos. Como fuimos entrenadas nosotras."
    ama "The C's and D's, mainly. They train the new guys like they were trained. Like we were trained."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2314
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a4bf90de:

    # mc "Lo primero que quiero hacer cuando llegue a Aruba, entonces, es reunirme con los C y los D. Y quiero sus nombres. No quiero pensar en ellos como letras."
    mc "The first thing I want to do when I get to Aruba, then, is to meet with the C's and the D's. And I want their names. I don't want to think of them as letters."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2316
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c07cbb22:

    # "Pasáis los siguientes minutos haciendo planes y números, modificando las ideas de [ama], ampliando la información que tienes sobre la empresa. Tomando más cafés."
    "You spend the next few minutes making plans and crunching numbers, modifying [ama]'s ideas, expanding on the information you have about the company. Drinking more coffee."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2317
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_337e57f0:

    # "Al cabo casi una hora, suena una alarma en el móvil de [ama]."
    "After almost an hour, an alarm goes off on [ama]'s cell phone."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2319
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_c36b8809:

    # ama "Voy a tener que irme. Me toca relevar a [eva]. Lleva casi 30 horas sin dormir."
    ama "I have to go. It's my turn to relieve [eva]. She hasn't slept for almost 30 hours."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2320
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_7a628fb8:

    # ama "Recopilaré todos los datos y te los mando. Supongo que en un par de días los tendré hechos."
    ama "I will compile all the data and send it to you. I guess in a couple of days I'll have it done."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2321
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_7b2c571d:

    # mc "Genial. ¿Vais a venir a casa a cenar esta noche?"
    mc "Great. Are you guys coming home for dinner tonight?"

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2323
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_45b1f444:

    # ama "Sí, hemos ido a comer, pero no estabas."
    ama "Yes, we went to lunch, but you weren't there."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2325
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_250366b8:

    # mc "Ya sabes que había quedado para comer con [kia]."
    mc "You know I had a lunch date with [kia]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2327
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_debde37a:

    # mc "Ya sabes que tenía que llevar a [meg] a la estación de autobuses."
    mc "You know I had to take [meg] to the bus station."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2328
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_a7810a76:

    # ama "Lo sé..."
    ama "I know..."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2330
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_97d1780f:

    # ama "Entonces te veo esta noche."
    ama "Then I'll see you in the evening."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2333
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_f80d270f:

    # "[ama] se vuelve a lanzar a tus labios, esta vez sin el ansia del beso anterior. Sabe que vendrán más."
    "[ama] throws herself on your lips again, this time without the eagerness of the earlier kiss. She knows more will come."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2336
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_b7bb21ab:

    # "Os dais un abrazo de despedida. Tácitamente, sin necesidad de palabras, habéis decidido que los besos de despedida están de más ahora que habéis aclarado que no estaréis juntos."
    "You hug [ama] as goodbye. Tacitly, without the need for words, you have decided that goodbye kisses are superfluous now that you made it clear that you will not be together."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2338
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_705a5ed1:

    # ama "Hasta la noche, [mc]."
    ama "Until the evening, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c21/c21.rpy:2339
translate english c21s004_AmandaCoffee_70d3a368:

    # mc "Hasta la noche, [ama]."
    mc "See you in the evening, [ama]."

